<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">EN_ULT en_English_ltr Fri Feb 21 2020 15:26:31 GMT-0500 (EST) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mark ne Raukegai Samliakeyi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mrk.</para>
  <para style="mt">Mark</para>
  <para style="mt">Mark Samliakeyi</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Mark, Samliakeyi (AD 50-60) aide keraube, pa Jisu teilung hadung raukegai raitube kera nzwa. Pa au Paul penai Barnabas de ngngwa mmi kekiee ge zierang ta tei kecube delie nlum la.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mark laisiukwak, samriadung mede mahadung be mene petingbe nah hetadung rangmting kigai, aide Samliakeyi laisiudung kakde Khrista teilung ha rau mcoktube lie. Cide Samliakeyi kakde duitube liede, cide rang kezangtube ge. Raitu gade Mark au Khrista bata hadung ranggai, keraide pa miswakegahbata tei kegaidung.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mark au Jisu heta keteime ge nah kengkieng kebam liagai. Pa laisiukwak zi cum zi ge au Khrista mtakkak kekambe kideu ga heta keteidung ha ranggai, kelikelube tsit nah ringcuhkedi ha le kekambe tei eh.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Pedwale ha nah ketelei (1:1-13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Teikengkei nah keledeudung (1:14-8:26)</para>
  <para style="io1">Jisu nah ledeukelumedung (8:27-10:45)</para>
  <para style="io1">Jericho penai Jerusalem (10:46-13:37)</para>
  <para style="io1">Khrista reikebeu nah pe tsit (14:1-15:47)</para>
  <para style="io1">Khrista ringcuhkelu nah pe caisuimedung (16:1-20)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Duipumketeibe John lampui mteikecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Aide Tinggwang Nabe Jisu Khrista samliakeyi ndeu kelube da.<verse eid="MRK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Caihakecibe Isaiah raupwa kebam nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">“Ainie, Ih nzu kengau dwa a samgwabe de lang gaila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">pa n lampui teleibeu kerabe da.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal. 3:1</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 11:10">Mat. 11:10</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 7:27">Luk. 7:27</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Mige hetaideu gade sahbakla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Rampaube lampui telei lulo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">pe lampui tei mzui lulo.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa. 40:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Samgwabe John, hetaideu lamde mimau gilukera helungkenreu duipum sam teu mide ledeu eh gwang. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Cidau Judeame deudi pelane gade nah Jerusalem namdi ga mina peciakne peda miedi. Penui maudung petlu eh Jordan Reuki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jordan Reuki: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kereuki aide Asia Kenlütle ga kereuki ketiee ge, kilometre 251 Jaaidi Ketsai gage lwagai bam. </char></note> gade pe ba gade penui duipum tei kaplu. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />John au ut maile tei kelu paini teula nah teigeu kiakang le pe kia kangpung la, nah pa tangrim penai heliadui tyeila.<verse eid="MRK 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Cidau pa mide ledeu eh ranggai, “Aswa digwa kecuge acai gwangzie, Ih au keukeimie pe picumria de hiak kera de luimelie. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Ih au dui gade nnuide duipum tei beula, dede pa au Kemci Rabe gade nnuide duipum tei beuzie.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu de duipum ketei nah kehedei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Cipau tingdau Jisu Galilee deu Nazareth nam gade gwang eh Jordan Reuki gade John ne pecu duipum teilu. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Nah Jisu dui gade mpetlu siak pa tinggim letgai nah Kemci Rabe tamhau nzwa pe reuga nghung kela ngau. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Cidau tinggim gade makwa ge gwang, “Nang au a na akube. Ih ncu a suisüt bam.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Jisu duipum teiluge, zette Kemci Rabe pecu hetaideu ga mie kera ketang di. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Pa hetaideu ga zie riakdai bamdi, Satan ne pecu kedei eh. Cidau pa renaam kaune de ngngwa bam, dede tinggimgwame ne pe ma piebeu.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Caisui keraime de qukelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />John de tui kedicai, Jisu Galilee ga gwanglwe Tinggwang samliakeyi paurwa cuhdi. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Pa rangdi, “Peting cang dida<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Peting cang dida: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">samliakeyi de mzi kera kedet kelu ting nah Tinggwang hegwangram de liagai kera de.</char></note> nah Tinggwang hegwangram nna bam dida. Helungnreulu nah samliakeyi de nlum lulo.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Pa Galilee Jaaidi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Galilee Jaaidi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jaaidi de Israel tingpeu kepetle bie, Golan Kehu nah Galilee cuikui kakga, Jordan Langkam ga bam. </char></note> kung ga tetgwang keladau, pa Simon nah pe sinabe Andrew helang pwa jaaidi gage sambam eh ngau, penai heka tuikelame kecune. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Cine Jisu penai dage rangdi, “Gwanglu, acai suilu, iciude Ih nnaide peu mina de ketuime tei beuzie.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Ge penai helang de zette pütdi eh pecai suidi. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Ipaucai de Jisu tet mdei si pet ge, pa Zebedee napei kena James penai pe sinabe John liem ga penai helang retak bam eh ngaulu. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Nah Jisu zette penaide qugai ge penai pei Zebedee de penai liem gade liteu kela kilame de si eh pütdi, delwe penai pecai suidi.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu kemau rabe ge de gwakempet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Ge Jisu nah pe caisuime Capernaum namceu ga gwanglu, nah Sabbath benai Jisu synagogue ga lüt eh mide ledeu. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Cidau Jisu au laisiukecime nzwa mene, dede kengkieng kebamme nzwa eh penuide ledeu kedine pe keledeu samdung ne penui ma canghdi. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Cipau ting siakdau mcikemak rabe ne ngngwa kela mipei ge penui synagogue ga bam eh pa sahbak eh, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />ranggai, “Nazarethme Jisu, anui ncu ngngwa dai tei laino? Nang anuide teimsia dizie lie gwang lani? Nang caubi Ih ci, nang Tinggwang gu Kemcibe da!” <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Dede Jisu herakesiabe de kesiu eh ranggai, “Zing dedi nah pe dade mpet dilu!” <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Ge mcikemak rabe cipau peide de tei ngkau gai nah mra sahbak gai eh pe dade mpetdi. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Mina pelane penui swagah eh hangge ge de keteu eh ranggai, “Aide daino? Kengkieng kebam keledeu keheci ge! Pa mcikemak rabedungde de kesiu gai eh penui pesam mzai lula kecu!” <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Cine Galilee cuikui leune ga lule ailam zette pe ha rang zangra gwangdi.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu mina kekiee gede teingkeikebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Cipaucai synagogue gade mpetlu herizi, penui Simon penai Andrew ki ga, James penai John de si eh gwanglu. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Cidau Simon nau pui mra eh zeu bam, nah penui zette eh pe ha Jisu dage rangbeu. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Cine pa peda gwang, pe ba teulu, delwe pecu kwak ncuhgai. Ge kemra pecu pütdi, nah pa penui gwatei bamdi.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Cu tinghegi tingnaimiak nlüt dige<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jewme zai gade Sabbath benai kemrame ge de pwa kecude de heta ge lie rangla. Cine penui naimiak lütdi eh Sabbath cangdi kemaktane kemramedung de Jisu da ngngwa gwanglu kera kwa bamdi.</char></note> penui mateei kelame nah herakesiabe ne ngngwa kela pelane de peda ngngwa gwangbeu. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Nah namdi cika mina pelane gwang kikam ga ngkwalwe bamdi. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Cine pa mateei ketsamtsam mra kelame kekiee leude teingkei beu nah herakesiabe kekieede de gwadi, dede pa herakesiabedung de peu marang ma kedanemene penui pecu ci kedine.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu mina kegah gade kekie ketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Pecai tingcang nuge, mui kezeune, Jisu cuhlwe zing de kecu ni ga tetpet di, delwe cikade pa kekie tei. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Cidau Simon nah pecu ngngwa kelame pecu peeidi. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Penui pecu ngau luge, penui pe dade rangdi, “Mina kekiee ge ncu peeila dida.” <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Dede pa penui dage rangdi, “Anui tetpwa twagwa kebam namceu kedale miego, ciciu eh Ih cika de zierang teilu kerane. Kedanemene cide ziemne Ih gwangbam delu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Cine Jisu nah pe caisuime Galilee deu pelane ga mie, penui synagoguedung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:39 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Synagogue: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jewme kerecaki.</char></note> ga mide ledeu nah herakesiabedungde de gwampet eh.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kempame ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Ge kempame ge Jisu da gwang, pe ngha kie eh keumie. Pa pe dage ranggai, “Nang nsui cai acu teimci lubui.” <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Ge Jisu ngaugia le puipung eh pe ba hwapwa pecu deugai nah pe dage ranggai, “Ih asui da. Mcilu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Zette kempa de pe dade tetdi, nah pecu tei mcilu. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Dede Jisu pecu marang sünne gai eh zette pecu lang gidi. <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />Nah pa pe dage rangdi, “Nang mige dage de magede rang selo, dede mie, cingkupei de ncu pwalia lo, delwe ncu teikemci ratakdung Moses rang kenzeu de tei lulo, penui dade zierang ge lu kerane.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lev. 14:1-32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Dede pa mpet eh cipau ha de rangrwa ladi nah luga aika minadung de peu ci gwang kiee kedine, Jisu namceu ga mtei miakngau tei lütlu lakdi. Cine pa mie mina kegah heni ga bamdi, cipau caide mina lule ailam de Jisu da gwang cu mtaklu tadi.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Jisu kemnoime gede teingkei kebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Tingbazie kiee kemak gecai Jisu Capernaum namceu ga gwang dai luge, pa pe kiga bamlie kecu mina ci gwangdi. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Iciu eh mina kekiee cika gwang ngkwalu ge kikam ga kecangde mina sap kera heni gahdi, nah Jisu penui dage Tinggwang sam ranggai. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Cidau midungge kemnoime ge de peda pwagwang; pecu mina hang mdai ne pwala. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Mina maabe ziemne penui petai nna gailak kedidau, penui Jisu kebam kireu gade ki raklu, delwe ngkei kelucai, penui kemnoibe zeu kebam zeu de pwa nghung gai. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Ge Jisu penui kenlum ngau eh, pa kemnoibe dage rangdi, “A na, n maudung gibeu dide lie.” <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Ge laisiukecime kangge de cika kilung ga bam, ge penui penui lung gade keteudi, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Mina aipaude daitei aikenzwa ge rangla bi? Pa Tinggwang de rangmsiala dida! Dede Tinggwang rünne kemakcai caune kemaudung gibeu lulai?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:25">Isa. 43:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Ge Jisu zette pe rabe gade penui lungcet de cilu. Jisu penui dage keteudi, “Nnui daitei eh nnui lung gade ma aiciu kecu cet lano? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Kemnoibe dage, ‘N mau gibeu dida’ de kecube mi ‘Cuhlu, nzeu pwalu, delwe tetcu,’ de kecube rangla ki zieno? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Dede kideureu mina maudung gibeulu kebui Mina Nabe da kengking kebam nnuide peu cilu kerane,” Pa kemnoibe dage ranggai, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Ih n dage rang gaila, cuhlu, n zeu pwalu, delwe n kiga gwangdi lulo.” <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Cine pa cuhlu delwe zette pe zeu teupwa pelane dwa gade tet mpetdi. Ciziemne, penui pelane penui macangh kapdi nah penui Tinggwang de twa eh rangdi, “Anui aikenzwa madaude ngau mezing reu.”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Levi de qukelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Ipaucai Jisu Galilee jaaidi kungle gwang dai lage, mina maabe pelane peda gwanglu, ge pa penuide ledeu gai. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Pa gwang kenzeu dau, pa Alphaeus napei Levi heraha keha paiki ga bam eh ngaulu eh pa pe dage rangdi, “Acai sui lulo.” Ge pa cuhlu delwe pecai suidi.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Pecai Jisu Levi ki gade matyei bam, nah heraha kehame nah kemaume kekiee de Jisu nah pecaisuimedung de ngngwa matyei bam, penui mina kekiee ge pecai suila kedine. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Ge laisiukecime, Phariseemedung Jisu kemaume nah heraha hakelame de ngngwa matyei kebam ngau eh, penui pecaisuimedung dage keteudi, “Daitei eh pa heraha hakelame nah kemaume de ngngwa matyei lano?” <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Jisu sam cide cilu ge pa penui dage rangdi, “Pe pum yi kemcangme au daru kecime de teu maisia ma, dede keteeime ziemne lie. Ih masang kelame de qu kerane gwang ma dede kemaumedung de qu kerane gwang.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kemmwang ha Jisu dade keteukecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Cu John caisuime penai Phariseemedung mmwang bam, ge penui gwang Jisu dage rangdi, “Daitei John caisuime nah Phariseeme caisuime mmwang zeu delwe n caisuimedung be mmwang meno?” <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Cine Jisu penuide sam keligai, “Lakciube penuide ngngwa kebam dau pe zangnamedung mmwang bam lubui ni? Lakciube penuide ngngwa kebamtane, penui mmwang gailak. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Dede peting ge gwang zie, penui dade lakciube de ngngwa tetdi kera, nah cipau tingdau penui mmwang dizie. <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Migede pai keheci teugwang pai kehegwa ge gage kopgai lama. Mecai pai cikade hakpet dizie, keheci pai kehegwa pai gade, nah hak mdi si dizie. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Cinzwa eh migede zauci pwa teigeula kehegwa gage kai lama. Mecai zauci de pelabe de pungpop dila, iciu eh zau nah teigeulabe de teimsia dila. Meliene, zau keheci pwa teigeula keheci gage kaila.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sabbath Rampaube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Cipaucai Sabbath benai, Jisu nah pe caisuimedung luh kakga tet kahgwang, nah pe caisuimedung tet jüja hereibui mriet ladi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:25">Hez. 23:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Cine Phariseeme kangge pe dage rangdi, “Pielo, n caisuime daitei Sabbath benai hezai kemakbe tei lano?” <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnui madaude kesanglaisiu ga pei meni, David nah pecu ngngwa kelame bau maisia kedidau nah mzeu kedidau daipai teibi kecu? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Abiathar cingku kedibe ketei tingdau, pa Tinggwang ki ga lüt delwe cingkume rünne gwale tyei kera hezai kemak, Tinggwang de reca kebeu tangku de tyei nah pa pecu ngngwa kelamede de kesa peu kecu?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam. 21:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Pecai pa penui dage rangdi, “Sabbath nai au mina ziemne teigai, nah mina de au Sabbath nai ziemne teigai ma. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Ciziemne, Mina Nabe au Sabbath reude Rampaube lie.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Cipaucai Jisu synagogue ga lüt dai ge, mige peba tsai kedi ge cika bam. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Mina kangge, pa Sabbath benai cipaude de tei mmi beu zie mi lak bi kecu pecu pie ling eh bam, iciu eh pecu mmaulu kerane. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Cine Jisu pe ba ketsaibe pei de dage rangdi, “Anui kakga saplu.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Pecai pa minadung dage rangdi, “Sabbath benai mi dage ma keyi tei kerabe mi kesia tei kerabe petau no; mide kelilu kerabe mi mide teitset kerabe no?” Dede penui zing de di. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Ge pa penui lung ketakne pe lung sia eh pe rata eh nreupet lule ailam penuide pie eh mina cipaude dage rangdi, “N ba nzang pet gailo.” Cine pa pe ba nzang pet gaige pe ba tei ngkeilu. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Ge Phariseemedung mpetlu delwe zette Herodiame de ngngwalwe dainzwa Jisu de teitset lubui bi riem bamdi.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maadibe Jisu caikesui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Pecai Jisu ledeukelumedung de ngngwa Galilee jaaidi lebie miedi nah Galilee deuzi gade nah Judea gade mina maadi ge pecai suidi <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />nah Jerusalem gade nah Idumea gade nah Jordan reu lulegim de nah Tyre penai Sidon namdidung gade mina maadi ge pecai suidi. Cidau penui pa tei kela ha de siulu ge mina maadi ge peda gwang. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Cine pa hemaabe de peu pecu ziudi melu kerane pa ledeukelumedung de liem keceunage pe ziemne mtei lulo beu. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Pa mina kekiee de tei hemi kebeune penui teeinei kela leu pecu deu zielie petai ga gwang. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Keheidaude mcikemak rabedung de pecu ngau luge pe dwaga keumie eh sahbak eh rangdi, “Nang au Tinggwang Nabe.” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Dede pa penuide kesiusüt gai, iciu eh peu penuide midage de pe ha rang melu kerane.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Langkegaime kereiekena kedetkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Pecai Jisu lamlwa reu nghanglu delwe pe caisui keneume gwang lulo qugai, ge penui peda gwanglu. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Pa mina kereiekena de kedetlu (pa penuide langkegaimedung lie msiaklu) iciu eh penuide peu pecu ngngwala lu kerane nah pa penuide langpwa mide ledeu kera, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />nah herakesiabe de gwalu kera kengkieng bamlu kerane. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Pecai pa kereiekena bau de kedetlu: Pa Simon de, Peter lie msiaklu; <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Zebedee napei James, nah pe sinabe John, pa aipau kena zi msiak pwa Boanerges<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Boanerges: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aipau sam de Hebrew let gade sam kena kaikencüt, pekie, “Tingkeceu na kena.”</char></note> qulu, cide pekie Tingceu napei; <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />nah Andrew, Philip, Bartholomew, Matthew, Thomas, Alphaeus napei James, Thaddaeus, Simon Zealot, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />Nah Judas Iscariot, pecai pecu tuigai kebeube.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu nah Beelzebul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Piage Jisu nah pe caisuime kige ga lütlu, ge mina maabe gwang ngkwa dailu, cine penui tangku tyeide gailak di. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Pe kilungme bau cide siu luge, penui mie pecu ngngwa luzie miedi, kedanemene penui rangdi, “Pa au mie dida.” <verse eid="MRK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Ge Jerusalem gade nghungkela laisiukecime de rangdi, “Pa Beelzebul de ngngwala dida” nah “Herakesiabe gwang de ngngwa eh pa herakesiabe de gwampetla.” <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Dede Jisu penuide qupwa pedage kailu eh samgwa penui dade rangdi, “Satan dainzwa eh Satan de gwalu laino? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Magade hegwangram pekatei pecu pungpang di cai hegwangram cide sap gailak. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Ki ge pekatei pecu pungpang di cai ki cide sap gailak dizie. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Nah Satan de pekatei pecu renia dicai nah nzipang dicai, pa sap gailak, dede penli ga gwang dila. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Iciu de migede kengkiengme gede kanglu rai mene kengkingme ki ga lüt pe gudung rega gailak, kang railu cai, pa pe kilung lüt pe gudung hedi lubui. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, minadung kemau leune teide nah mide rangkemsia sam leune rangde penui maugi beuzie, <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />dede mina keheibe de Kemci Rabe de rang msia cai madaude gibeu lak, dede kelungta kemau ziemne pecu peu mau dizie”, <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />kedanemene penui, “Mcikemak rabe peda la,” de eh kerangne.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu pui nah sinamedung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Cidau Jisu pui nah pe siname gwang kisie ga saplu. Penui mide langpwa pecu qu. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Nah mina maabe pecu twagwapung ntum bam, ge penui pe dade rangdi, “Ainie! N pui nah n siname ncu peeigwang kisie ga bamlie.” <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Ge pa penui sam keli eh ranggai, “A pui nah a siname cauno?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Ge pa nreugwang pecu twagwapung kebamdung de pie eh rangdi, “Ainie, aika a pui nah a sinamedung! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Mina keheibe de Tinggwang suibe tei nah mzai kelume cipaume a siname, a time nah a pui delie.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Heleuh nrokkegai samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Pecai Jisu Galilee jaaidi kung gade mide ledeu cuh daidi, ge mina maadi ge gwang petaiga twagwalu. Ciziemne pa Galilee jaadi ga liem ge ga lütlu delwe cika bamlu. Mina maabe pelane jaaidi kung ga bam. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Ge pa samgwa gade ma kekiee pwa penuide ledeu, nah pa penuide ledeu kecu dau penui dage rangdi, <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Kingnei lulo! Ainie, heta ketame ge heleuh gi zielie mie. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Pa heleuh gi gaige, heleuh kesa lampui kung ga cakmie di, ge nruinedung ne gwang cidungde nsau tyeilu. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Nah heleuh kesa tsura reu ga cakmie lu, cika tangdei bam sütma. Cide pwak zette cuhlu, kedanemene cide tangdei bam ki kemakne. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Dede tingnaimiak taugai ge, mabangdung de puki di, nah cidungde pe mah cok kemakne, penui reguidi. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Nah heleuh kesa hetu kakga cakmiedi. Hetu bangdung lungcuh delwe cide zimdi, delwe cide petsi gede builu tadi. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Nah heleuh kesa pedeu keyi ga cakmie gailu eh pwaklu nah lungcuh petsi builu iciu eh tsi camrei, riakherok, nah hai kecang builu.” <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Iciu eh pa rangdi, “Mina keheibe de pekwen bam eh kingnei keneume de peu kingnei lulo!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Cidau Jisu pekatei kebam dau pecu twagwapung kebamdung kereiekena bau de si eh gwang samgwa ha keteu di. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Cine pa penui dage rangdi, “Tinggwang hegwangram ha sam kecukdung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kecukdung: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jisu Tinggwang hegwangram ha sam kecukung minadung pedwa ci kemak de keuliagai.</char></note> pwa nnuide peu dida. Dede hegwale kebamme de au ma leune de samgwa gade,<verse eid="MRK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />cine penui pie au piela, dede ngaula melie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">nah penui siu au siula, dede cila melie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">iciu eh penui nreugwang eh penui maugi melu kerane.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa. 6:9-10</ref>, <ref loc="JER 5:21">Jer. 5:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Ge Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Nnui samgwa aide ci melie ni? Iciu cai nnui dainzwa eh samgwa keda pelane cilu laino? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Heleuh kegibe sambe pwa gi gaila. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Lampui kung ga cakmie kedibe aidungde da, sambe cika kelütdung de penui sambe cide siulu ge, Satan zette gwang eh penui lung kelüt samdung de süt dai teu dila. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Cinzwa eh tsura reu ga kemie aidungde da, penui sambe siu luge penui suiyi süt eh mzai zette lula. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Dede penui mah kegahne kak nage rünne bam kelu gwale tadi la. Iciu eh sambe ziemne keherei mede teikeherei kecu gwang ge penui zette kau dila. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Nah keda hetu kakga kelüt aidungde da. Aidungde sambe siu kelume, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />dede cudau teilung hadung cet pwa penui lungpang tei nah mi de cwa kela mabamdung nah ma keda kehengim penui lung lüt eh sambe de zim di nah cide petsi builu tadila. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Dede pedeu keyi ga cakmie keludung au sambe siulu eh cetpwa pegu teilu eh penui tsi camrei, nah riakherok nah hai petsi builu keladung delie.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mitaubung ge pe bam reuga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Jisu penui dage rangsi di, “Nnui mibung ge mabam reu gage kai kerane mi zeukang gage kai kerane pwa gwang lano? Cide mitaubam gage kailu kerane meni? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Peu mide ci nah ngau kerane gwale magede kebai kemzeu gah, nah peu mide cilu zielie kecube gwale magede ngkim kenzeu ga. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Mina keheibe de pekwen bam eh kingneilu kebuime de peu kingnei lulo!” <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Ge pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnui ma kekingneibe sünne lu, nnui pwa ndet kelabe pwa ndet dai pwa nnuide peu daizie, nah nnuide kaisi dai beuzie. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Kedanemene kebambe de peu kiee si zie, nah kegahbe dade kebam na de de keuteu si di zielie.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lunghkebam tsileu ge samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Ge Jisu rang si eh, “Tinggwang hegwangram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tinggwang hegwangram: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cide au Jisu ledeu kegwang gade kemlang ket.</char></note> au mige heleuh teu mie hangdeu gage nrok kegai nzwa da. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Pa tingmui gwang zipdi nah tingba luge cuhlu eh heleuh de dainzwa eh pwakcuh di lula bi pa cikemak nzwa delie. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Kideube petsi builu: Keraibe pebui petlu, pecai pe meibum petlu, pecai meitsi ci lula. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Nah peciube meulu ge luhlüt ting kedine pa tangkane teu mei rum cuhla.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:13">Joe. 3:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zeigi tsi samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Pa rang daidi, “Anui Tinggwang hegwangram de pwa daige de keu keda lulai mede anui daipai samgwa lepwa mi dage ranglia lulai? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Cide au ziegitsi nage nzwa delie, cide tangdei gage ling kegai dau, kideu ga kebam heleuh pelane kakde ceutu nage. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Dede, cide ling kegai dau, cide pwakcuh eh hegurie bangdung pelane swade di dila, delwe pekiak lung di lula, iciu eh tinggim nruinedung cipau kangga penui cietdung teu lula.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Palestine ga ziegi tsingbang nzwa lungla nah pe kiakdung ga nruinedung penui ciet teila. </char></note><verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Cine penui cilu kebui kieege, samgwa aikenzwa kekiee teu pa penuide ranglia, <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />nah pa samgwa teu mene penui dage marang ma. Dede pa pekatei kebam dau, pa ledeukelumedung de maleune rang mci lia beu.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu rahang de kaamkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Cipaunai ting hegi dige, pa penui dage rangdi, “Anui Galilee lulebie gim mpetdi go.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Cine penui maadi de gidi, penui Jisu liem ga kelane pecu ngngwalwe gwangdi. Nah cika pecu ngngwa liem kedadung de lasi. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Ge cidau tingkai kaidi ge gui gwang eh dui nswakdung de ne liem teu kenuak gai eh liem de dui kepuih teidi. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Dede Jisu pekatei liem cai lebie, bam ge ga zipzeu, ge penui pecu ngkia eh pe dage rangdi, “Keledeubo, anui tsai dilai kezeu ngau nang nlung pang meni?” <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Ge pa mraklwe tingkai de kesiu gai, nah jaaidi de, “Zing de dilu!” de ranggai. Ge tingkai de mtakdi nah cika zing dedi. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Pecai pa caisuime dage keteudi, “Nnui daitei mahing au no? Nnui cu de nnui kenlum bamlu mereu ni?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 107:29">Lei. 107:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Iciu ge penui ngngi süt eh hangge ge dade rangdi, “Mina aipau de daikenzwa ge no, tingkai nah jaaididung de pe sam mzai kela ai?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Herakesiabe kila ge de teingkei kebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Pecai Jisu nah pe caisuimedung jaaidi kung lule gim, Gerasenes cuikui ga gwanglu. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Jisu liem gade mpet kela dau, zette eh mige mcikemakpe rabe ne keliang teu kelage heraudung gade mpet pecu redau. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Cipaude heraudung ga lung bamla. Migede pecu hegeuria lede kangteu bamde gai lakti. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Kedanemene ma kekiee ge mi hegeu bakap nah hegeuria lepwa pecu kang, dede pa hegeuria de tei cakdi nah hegeu bakapdung de kesau cumdi. Migede pecu nimteu bamlu kera kengkieng gahdi. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Pa tingmui tingba ramsangne heraudung ga nah lamlwadung ga, sahbak eh pekatei pecu tangtsu pemui keyi gele kam bamla. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Pa kemdei gade Jisu de ngaulu ge, pa peda pak gwang delwe pe dwaga keumie di. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Nah pa sahbak eh ranggai, “Hutube Tinggwang Na Jisu, Ih ncu ngngwa daipai tei laino? Ih Tinggwang zi teu, acu tei keherei helo de nda a nggia kiela.” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Kedanemene Jisu pe dade, “Nang mcikemak rabo, mina aipau de dade mpetti lulo,” de rang kegaine. <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Pecai Jisu pecu keteugai, “N zi cau no?” Pa pecu keligai, “A zi au Legion lie, anui kekiee ge kecune.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Ge pa Jisu dade penuide cikade gwa di helo kiebi di. <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Cidau hebak maadi ge kideutu pi ga matyei la, <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />ge penui pe dade kiebi eh, ranggai, “Anuide hebak maa gage langgai dilo, iciu eh anui cipaudung de lungga lütlu kerane.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Ge Jisu penuide gwang dilo beu. Ge mcikemak rabe cidungde pet eh tetpwa hebak hau ga lütdi. Ge pehau de, hebak cangna kenzwa ge, hetialwa de pak hung jaaidi ga lütdi, delwe jaaidi gage hegak tset kapdi. <verse eid="MRK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Pecai hebak de kekwame pakgwang eh namdi ga nah luhdung ga paukap gai, ge mina kekiee daipai tei dibi pie zielie gwang. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Pecai penui Jisu da gwang eh herakesiabe ne keliangteu kelabe de, Legion ne pecu keliangteu kelabe de, pelung mrak lu nah pepaini kailwe ntum kebam ngaulu eh penui ngngi sütti. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Herakesiabe ne keliang teu kelabe da tei kegai kengaumedung cipau hade nah hebakdung hade minadung dage ranglia. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Ge penui Jisu de penui cuikui gade tetti lo kie cuhdi. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Pecai pa liem gega lütti zeuge herakesiabe ne keliangteu kelabe de pecu ngngwa la kera pe dade kiedi. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Dede Jisu rau eh pe dage rangdi, “N kilung nah n mina da gwang culo nah penui dage Rampaube n ziemne ma kedi daikenzwa teigai bi kecu, nah daikenzwa Ih ncu a ngaugia keulia bi kecu rang lo.” <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Cine pa tetdi nah Decapolis gade Jisu pe ziemne ma kedi daikenzwa ge teigai bi kecu midage rangla di; iciu eh mina pelane de penui macangdi.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Relei ketsai ge nah mateei kela pui ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Pecai Jisu liem gade lulegim kahpet dai luge, mina maadi ge gwang peda ngkwalu nah cidau pa jaaidi kung ga bam. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Ge, pielo, Jairus lie kecu synagogue<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Synagogue: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jewme Kerecaki. </char></note> ga muiteume ge gwang pecu ngau luge, pa pepi ga keumie di. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Nah pa pe dade penggia kie daidai eh rangdi, “A napuina tsai dilau zeuda. Pecu teingkeilu eh ring dailu kerane nang gwang delwe n ba hwa pwa pecu deu gailo.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Cine Jisu pecu ngngwa meidi, nah mina maadi ge pecai sui nah pecu nia twagwa ladi.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Ge mipui mmi kereiekena hejai la kedi pui ge cika la. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Pa darukecime kekiee dade pie, nah pe mabam pelane mpetdi, dede yilu ma, ciciu meliene pa sia reureu di. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Cipau pui de Jisu ha siulu ge, maadi kakga pecaile gwang eh pe ncwa tunggai. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Kedanemene pa rangdi, “Ih pepai nage de tunggai cai, Ih yilu zie.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Pejai lwa kela de cang zette di, nah pe mateei ngkei kedi pe pum gade cidi. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Jisu pe dade kengkieng<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kengkieng: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tei kengkei kengkieng</char></note> pet kedi zette cilu. Pa nreu lule ailam mina maabe de pie eh keteudi, “Cau a pai deu no?” <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Ge pe caisuime pe dage rangdi, “Nang pielo mina maadi aide ncu siang titi la mene, ‘Caune acu tung no?’” de nang rangzeu no. <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Dede Jisu pepai kedeube de pie zielie lule ailam piegai. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Cidau cipau puide pe dade mateei mpetkedi cilu eh ngngi nah mbeu eh gwang pe dwaga keumie, nah pe dage samsangbe rangliadi. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Dede pa cipau pui dade rangdi, “A napoi, n kenlum ne ncu tei ngkei luda, n mateei depeu yilu eh n lung nciep eh tet mie lu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:48">Luk. 8:48</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Pa sam aidungde rang bamreu kecune, synagogue ga muiteume ki gade mina kangge gwang eh ranggai, “N napui tsai dida. Peu daitei keledeube de tei keherei si lalai?” <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Dede Jisu penui kerang sam cidungde siu luge, pa synagogue ga muiteube dade rangdi, “Ngngi diso, nlum eh bamlu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Iciu eh pa Peter, James nah pe sinabe John, de gwale mige dede peu pecai suila raudi. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Penui synagogue muiteube ki ga gwangcang luge, mina penui lung sia eh hei eh hapsüt kebam pa ngaulu. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Pa lüt kecudau, pa penui dage rangdi, “Daitei nnui nnui lung sia eh hap zeu no? Hena nabe tsaidi ma, dede zipzeu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Ge penui pecu nuidi. Dede pa penui pelane de peu kisie mpetdi nah hena nabe pei penai pepui nah pecu ngngwa kelame bau de ngngwa hena nabe kebam ga pa lütti. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Ge pa hena nabe ba teulu eh pe dage rangdi, “Talitha koum!” Cide pekie, “Releipoi, Ih n dage rangla, cuhlu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Ge releipuina de zette cuhlwe tet ladi (pa mmi kereiekena ge dide kecune) Aide kengaume penui macang zette pwa mage teidi. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Ge pa mide peu cide ci melu kerane penuide kaambi di. Nah pa penuide releipui de matyei kera peulo gai.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Caihakecime de kerüt kegah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Cidau Jisu cikade mpet di nah pe nam Nazareth ga gwanglu, nah pa ledeukelumedung pe caisui gwang. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Sabbath cang luge, pa synagogue gade ledeu ndeudi. Mina kekiee pekwa kingnei luge penui macangdi eh hangge ge dage ranggai, “Pa dai gade aidungde ngaulu dino? Pa daiga de maci aidungde ngaulu no nah miswakegah bata tei kera kengkieng ngaulu dino?” <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />“Aipaude Mary napei nah James nah Joses nah Judas nah Simon sinabe tsingta keteibe meni? Pe timedung aika anuide ngngwabam meni?” Penui pecu mlaidi. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Ge Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Caihakecibe ge au kerüt simene la lama, iciude pekatei peram nah pekatei pekilungme kakga nah pekatei pekilung gade au cide ngau lu ma.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Cine pa cika ma kedi gede teilu tadi, teeikeneeime kecam nage reuge pe ba hwapwa penuide tei ngkei kegai gwale. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Nah penui nlumkemei de ne pa peswagahdi. Aipaucai pa renamdung ga ledeu rwa ladi.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu kereiekena de langmpet kegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Pecai pa kereiehkena bau de qulu delwe hangna-hangna tei eh langmpet gai, nah pa penuide mcikemak rabe reu kengkieng peu, <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />nah penui beuh ga hetuitie ge rünne gwale magede keu mene tet kera rangbeu, tangku, mede hebie, mede penui kiakang ga rangkang gede teu helo di, <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />dede picumbe kailu, nah iciude mcwa kena mcwa helo di. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Pa penui dage ranggai si, “Nnui kehei daude ki ga kelüt dau, nnui cikade tetti kemaktane cika bam lulo. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Kehei gade mi nnuide ngngwa luma mede nnui sam de kingnei mecai, nnui cikade tet keradau, penuide kemmau zierang ge lu kerane rebui nnui pideu kang gade kecung gidi lulo.” <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Cine penui tetmie eh minadung de helungnreu lulo kecu rang ledeu ladi. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Penui herakesiabedung kekiee de gwa mpetti, nah mina keteeime kekiee gede maca pwa keniak eh penuide tei ngkeibeu.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Cidau, Hegwangpei Herod aide siulu, kedanemene Jisu zi ci ndu pet kedine. Midungge ranggai, “Duipumketeibe John ketsai gade ringcuh dida, nah ciziemne miswakegah bata pe dade teibam.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Dede kedamedung rangdi, “Pa au Elijah da.” Nah kedamedung rangdi, “Pa au ndaa caihakecime nzwa, caihakecibe hangge da.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Duipumketeibe John peu dangkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Dede Herod aide siu kelu dau pa rangdi, “Ih pepeu dang kedibe John ringcuh dida.” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Kedanemene hegwangpei Herod pa ne langpwa John de tuih nah pecu kangpwa hebaangki gage kaidi hegwangpui Herodias (pe sinabe Philip nau) ziemne, kedanemene pa pecu pe nau kelune. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Kedanemene John Herod dage ranggai, “Nang n sinabe nau de lu kera hezai gade nang petau ma.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:16">Lev. 18:16</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 20:21">Lev. 20:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Dede Herodias aide ziemne John de mmaudi nah pecu teitset neudi, dede pa tei gailak di, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Kedanemene Herod John de hing, pa John au masang nah mci lie kecu ci kebamne, nah pa pecu hebaangki gage kebai nzeudi. Pe sam siu luge pe lung keherei sütdi, ciude pesui yi eh pa pe sam kingnei lula. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Pecai ziuyi keyi ge daulu, Herod pe kangga kedimedung, nah pe reugwame reu muibedung, nah Galilee ga muiteume ziemne pe kemna tingba taktyei telei kelu dau. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Pecai Herodias napui pekatei lüt penui ziemne helim limbeu, pa Herod nah cika taktyeibam ga kebam medung suiyi teigai. Hegwangpei releipui dade ranggai, “Nang dai luneu labi keheibe de kielu, nah Ih cide ncu peu beu zie.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Pa pe dage sampetgai, “Nang keheibe a dade kie cai, Ih ncu peu beu zie, a hegwangram pempie ge kecang de.” <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Cine pa mpetlu eh pe puide keteu, “Ih dai kie zieno?” Pa rangdi, “Duipum keteibe, John peu kie lulo.” <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Pa hegwangpei da zette nli nlüt, nah kiegai, “Ih ncu peu duipumketeibe John peu hekwak ge gage kailwe acu pwapeu kelwa neu lie.” <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Hegwangpei pelung keherei sütdi liede, pa pecu keli di gailakdi kedanemene pe sampet de ziemne nah taktyeibam ga pecu ngngwa kebamme ziemne. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Cine hegwangpei zette mide gitset kelabe de langpwa John peu pwa gwang kera aja kaigai. Cine pa mie hebaangki gade pe peu dangdi. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Pa John peu hekwak gage kailwe pwa gwang nah cide releipui de pwapeu, nah releipui cide pepui de pwa peudi. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />John caisuime aide siu keludau, penui gwang eh pe paau pwalu delwe herau ge gage kaidi.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu mina cang mengei pokketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Pecai langkegaime Jisu da gwang ngkwalu, delwe penui tei kegaidung nah mide keledeudung leune pwa pecu lia. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Ge pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnui nnuikatei mi kegah ga gwanglu eh tingkak nage mtaklu.” Kedanemene mina kekiee ge gwang nah nli dai kecu recak kemakne nah penui matyei kera ting de ngaulu kemakne. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Cine penui penuikatei liem gade tetpwa mina kegah gage tet gaidi. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Dede mina penui tet kecu ngaulu, nah kekiee ge penuide cilu. Cine penui namceu leune gade maage tei eh pak gwang, nah penui penui dwa gwang raidi. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Jisu jaaidi kung ga mpet luge, pa mina maadi de ngaulu nah pa penuide ngau pelung siadi, kedanemene penui meuründung kekwame gah eh kela nzwa kedine. Cine pa penuide ma kekiee rangpwa penuide ledeu cuhdi. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Tinghegi dige, ledeukelume peda gwang eh rangdi, “Aide au renaam, nah tingbazie be de ridi zeu da. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Penuide langbeu dilo iciu eh penuide peu renam taiga nah renamdung gade mie eh penuide peu penui ziemne ketyei kesak luilu kerane.” <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Dede pa penui sam keli eh rangdi, “Nnui penuide peu matyei kera peulu.” Penui pe dage rangdi, “Anui mie tangku denarii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Denarii</char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinarius ge au langnai ge ziehi ge.</char></note> hai na mige luilu delwe peu penui de tyei kera ha zie ni?” <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Cine pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnui tangku dai kiee ge bam no? Mie lwe pielo.” Penui ngaulu ge, penui rangdi, “Tangku mengei nah heka kena.” <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Ge pa mina pelane de pemaa ketsamtsam tei eh hung tsehei kemdiak reuga bam lulo ranggai. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Cine penui haihai nah riakngei ngei maa tei eh bamdi. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Ge pa tangkudung mengei de nah heka pumna de keulu eh ngangcuh tinggim pie eh samlamgai nah tangkudung panglwe pwa minadung de peulo pe caisuime de peu. Pa heka kenade nzipwa mina pelane de peukap gai. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Penui pelane penui nggei kemaktane tyeilu. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Pecai penui tangku nah heka suidung hebie kereiehkena kepui palu. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Cika tangku tyei kelu mipeidung cang mengei bam.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu dui reu ketet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Zette eh pa ledeukelumedung de liem ga peu nlütlu nah peu jaaidi lule gim Bethsaida ga pedwa gwangdi, pa hemaabe de langgi bam kecudau ge. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Penui tet dige, pa lamlwa ga kekie tei kerane miedi. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Tinghegi gwang dige, liem de jaaidi sum ga ladi, nah pa pekatei kecang ga bam. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Nah tingkai penui dwale de penuide gui kedine liem taupa sütla kedi ngaulu. Tingmui reket releu pe mdaibe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:48 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Reket releu pe mdaibe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tingcang bam cum gade bam herok tingkak ga.</char></note> ting dauge pa dui reude tet gwang, nah pa penuide tetkah gwang neu, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />dede penui pa jaaidi reuga tetkela ngau keludau, penui pecu le pwane kengkei gelie eh sahbak gai, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Kedanemene penui pelane de pecu ngau eh penuide keheu süt kedine. Dede pa penuide mpau kelwa eh penui dage rangdi, “Kuu lulo, Ih lie, ngngi di helo!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Ge pa penui taiga liem ga nlütlu, ge tingkai gui tadi. Penui macang sütti. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Penui tangkudung ha de cilu kemakne. Dede penui lung takla di.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Penui tetka pwa hangdeu ga mpet kelu dau, penui Gennesaret nam ga gwanglu eh liem depeu zaaidikung ga bamlu. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Penui liem gade mpet keludau, mi pecu zette cilu, <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />nah penui cipau cuikui pelane ga pak gwang nah keteeikeneime leude zeu gage pwa pa bamlie kecu leune ga gwangla di. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Nah pa renamdung, mede namdidung, mede renaam ga kegwang leuga, penui keteeikeneime de pwa gwang litaknidung gage kai nzeu eh cidungde de peu pe pairi nade deulo eh kiebi kapdi, nah pecu deukelu leu kengkei ngau kaplu.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Mci nah mcikemak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Langnaige Jerusalem namdi gade gwang kebam Phariseemedung nah laisiukecime petai ga gwang ngkwalu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Nah ledeukelumedung kangge penui ba mci mene, cide penui ma mtiak mene, matyei kebam penui ngaulu. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />(Phariseeme nah Jewme pelane de penui ba mtiak di kemaktane matyei lama, kedanemene penui penui paume zai mzai kelane. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Penui litakni gade gwang keludau, duipia kemakne matyei lama, nah keda makekiee penui mzaikela ge bamsi reu: hepiakdung nah lidung nah hetageu lidung hui kela de si.) <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Phariseeme nah laisiukecime Jisu dade keteu, “Daitei nang ledeukelume anui paume zai rehi gade tet meno, dede penui ba mtiak mene matyei lano?” <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Dede pa samkeli eh penui dage rangdi, “Isaiah ndaa nnui hezai teikelamedung caiha rang delie, pa raugai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Mina aidungde penui muileu gade acu rütla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">dede penui nlungbe au a dade mdei lala.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Isa. 29:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Penui acu kemta gade reca la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">penui mina ne ketei zaidung le hezaibe teilwe ledeu.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Isa. 29:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Nnui Tinggwang sam kaikebeudung gidi eh mina ne tei kelu zaidung mzai siakte la dida.” <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Pa penui dage rang sigai, “Nnui ciem ci süt eh Tinggwang sam kaikebeu de gi dida, iciu eh nnui paumedung zai de kaizeulu kerane! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Kedanemene Moses rangla, ‘Nnui pui nnui pei de rütlu,’ nah ‘Keheibe de pe pui mede pe pei de rang msia kelame tsaibi dizie.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Tet. 20:12</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Hez. 5:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Dede nnui rang kecu, ‘Magade mige pe pui mede pe pei dage, “Makeheibe de nang a dade gie kelube au Corban”’ (cide pekie, ‘Tinggwang de peu dida’), de eh rangcai, <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />nnui pecu peu pe pei mede pe pui dage magede tei kera peu lama. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Nnui nnui paume zai de le Tinggwang sam kemta tei dida. Nah nnui cikenzwa makekiee ge teila.” <verse eid="MRK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Pecai pa mina maabe de qu dailu eh penui dage rangdi, “Nnui pelane de a kwa kingnei lu eh ci lulo. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Magede hegwale de mina lung lüt eh pecu tei heradi kela gah. Dede pelung gade kepetbe dungne pecu teihera dila.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Laisiudung kehegwa kesa pedum 16 de si la. </char></note> [Keheibe de kingneilu kera pekün bam cai pecu peu kingnei lulo.] <verse eid="MRK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Cu Jisu hemaabe de pütti eh kilung ga nlüt luge, pa ledeukelume samgwa ha keteu. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Pa penui sam keligai, “Nnui de maci mene aiciu lareu ni? Hegwale de mina lungga kelüt bene pecu teihera dila kemak nnui ngau meni, <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Kedanemene cide pe mlung ga lüt lama, dede pe za ga lüt dila; iciu delwe heteuki ga gwang dila?” (Ciziemne ketyeipuk pelane mci.) <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Dede pa rangdi, “Mina dade kepet dene mina de teihera dila. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Kedanemene mina lung gade, nlung gade, lungcet kesia, kemmha, kerega, teiketset pet la, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />Kemmha, makehengin, kenlien, mide kecwa, miriak kecu, mide kii kecu, ngang kecu, kemie. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Makesia cidungde pelane milung gade petla, nah cidungde mina de tei herala.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phoeniciame pui ge kenlum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Pecai pa Galilee gade Tyre penai Sidon cuikui lebie gwangdi. Pa kilung ge ga lütlu, nah migede de peu cineu ma, dede pa mbai gailak di. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Cidau mipui ge pe napui da mcikemak rabe ne keliangteu kela pui ge pe ha siulu eh pa gwang pe pi ga keumiedi. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Aipau puide Greekme ge, Syrophoeniciame pui. Pa pe napui dade herakesiabe de gwa gidi beulo pedade kie di. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Peu hename de nggei rai lulo. Kedanemene hename gu tangku de keulu eh heteu de pwa kepeu petau melu.” <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Dede pa samkeligai eh peda rangdi, “Yeo, Rampaubo, heteudung de taktyei bam kangga hename ne tei tangra kedibe pa tyeila.” <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Pecai pa cipau puide dage rangdi, “Sam aide ziemne, tetcuh. Herakesiabe n napui dade mpetti da.” <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Pa kilung caili gwang ge henanabe zeu ga zeubam nah herakesiabe mpet kedi ngaulu.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwenpang nah keletlaume gede teingkei kebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Ge Jisu nah pe caisuime Tyre cuikui gade tetpwa Sidon kegwang Galilee jaaidi nah Decapolis cuikui kecang gwang. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Penui cika mige kwenpang nah keletlaume ge de peda ngngwa gwang, nah pe reuga pe ba hwagai beulo penui kiedi. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Jisu pecu hemaabe dade ngngwa ntsam kelucai, pa pekün gage pe zurang kerigai, nah pa pe ncai pe ba gage kailwe pemleu tunggai. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Ge pa tinggim ngang pie eh pelung keherei kwa kwa eh pe dade rangdi, “Ephphatha!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">“Ephphatha!”: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aipau sam de au, “Syriac,” let, Jisu minabe de kempau dau kerang let de.</char></note> (pekie, “Ngkei dilu!”). <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Nah pa masiulu, nah pe mleu kangria ngheudi eh pa marang mcigi lu. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Jisu penuide midage de ranghelo beu. Dede pa penuide kaam reuge penui rang ndu reureu ladi. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Penui macang sütti eh ranggai, “Pa maleune tei hemi beu da. Pa kwenpangme de peu siulu nah peletkegahme de peu maranglu da.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Jisu mina cang mdai pukketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Cipau tingdau, mina maadi ge ngkwa dailu, nah penui magede tyei kera gah. Jisu pe caisuimedung de qulu delwe penui dade rangdi, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Ih mina maabe de ngaunggia dida, kedanemene penui lang cumne acu ngngwa la jüja dida nah cu penui magede tyei kera gah. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Ih penuide peu matyei mene penui ki gage langgaidi cai, penui lampuiki gade mmei di lubui, nah penui kangge au kemdei gade gwangla.” <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Pa ne ledeukelume pe sam keligai, “Dai gade cauge mina aidungde de peu matyei nggei lu kera renamkang gade ngaulu zieno?” <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Cine pa penuide keteu, “Nnui tangku daikiee ge bamno?” Penui ranggai, “Hena.” <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Ge pa hemaabe de hangdeu ga bam lulo beu. Pa tangku hena de keulu, Tinggwang de twagai eh tei panglu. Pa cidungde ledeukelumedung depeu iciu eh hemaabe de mzi beulu kerane. Nah penui mina maabe de mzi beu. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Penui heka keceunadung gede teula, nah pa cidungde reu gage samlam kelucai, pa penuide aidungde de mzi lulo rangbeu. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Penui tyei mnung lu, nah penui kebangbe pesuinadung pa pwa hebie hena puilu. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Cika mina cang mdai nsam ge bam. Pecai pa penuide langgi di. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Pa pe caisuime de ngngwa kelwa liem ga nlütlu, nah penui Dalmanutha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dalmanutha: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 15:39 ga cai, pa Magdala jaaidi kung ga gwanglu de eh rang. </char></note> cuikui ga miedi.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Cidau Phariseeme mpetlu eh pecu ngngwa kesamlim cuhdi. Penui pecu kedak eh tinggim gade marehi tei lialo di. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Pa pe rabe gade pesui kesia kwa kwa eh rangdi, “Daitei aipau ceheu de marehi pei lano? Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, marehi teipwa aipau ceheude de lia lakta.” <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Ge pa penui de pütdi eh liem ga nlüt dailu, nah Galilee jaai kedale gim gwangdi.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phariseeme gu tsehi nah Herod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Penui tangku pung gwang nsungta di, nah penui da liem ga tangku kwak ge rünne gwale la si tadi. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Ge Jisu penuide, “Phariseeme nah Herod tsehi gade nnui mriaksüt lulo,” de rang mriakgai. <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Cine ledeukelumedung ketket de mpau eh, “Cide anui tangku bam kemakne da,” dedi. <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Nah Jisu aide cilu eh penui dage rangdi, “Daitei nnui tangku bam kemak ziemne mpau lano? Nnui cetlu mereuni, mede cilu meni? Nnui lung teitak di deni? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Nnui miak bam eh ngau meni? Nah nnui kwen bam eh siu meni? Nah nnui nsung lu meni? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Ih mina cang mengei kakgade tangku kwak mengei pang kecudau, pesuina hebie kepuih daikieege pa ludi no?” Penui pe dage rangdi, “Kereiekena.” <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“Ih mina cang mdai kakga de tangku kwak hena pang kecu dau, pesuinadung hebie daikie ge pa ludi no?” Penui pe dage rangdi, “Hena.” <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Cidau pa penui de keteudi, “Dainzwa nnui cude cetlu me reu no?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bethsaida ga miakcitme gede teikengkei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Pecai penui Bethsaida renam ga gwanglu. Minadung miakcitme ge de peda ngngwa gwang eh pecu deu gailo kiedi. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Miakcitbe ba teulu eh Jisu pecu ngngwa renam gwale miedi. Pa pe mcai nsui pwa pe miak gage kai nah pe ba le deu gai eh pecu keteu, “Nang magede ngaumi?” <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Pa ngangcuh eh rangdi, “Ih minadung tsingbangdung tet kela nzwa ngau.” <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Pecai pa peba kena pwa pemiak gage kai dai, nah minabe pe miak ngkei gai, ge pe miak yilu eh pa maleune ngau mcihegi lu. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Ge Jisu pecu pe kilung gage langgai eh ranggai, “Namceu ga lüt helo.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peter Khrista ha kerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Pecai Jisu nah pa ledeukelumedung Caesarea Philippi namceudung ga miedi. Lampuiki gade, pa ledeukelumedung de keteugai, “Mi acu caulie rang lano?” <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Penui pecu keligai, “Duipumketeibe John lie. Kedame, ‘Elijah lie,’ nah kangge au, ‘Caihakeci hangge lie la.’” <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Pa penuide keteu, “Nnui be acu le cau lie lano?” Peter pesam keligai, “Nang au Khrista lie.” <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Ge Jisu penuide midage de pe ha ranghelo kaamdi.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu pe tsit ha mraikerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Pecai pa penui de ledeu cuhdi Mina Nabe ma kekiee ge gade keherei kera, nah hangkiamedung nah cingku kedimedung nah laisiukecime ne pecu mlaidi kera, nah pecu teitsetdi eh lang cumne cai ring cuh dailu kera. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Pa sam aide rang mcigi beu. Ge Peter pecu ngngwa tsam mpetlwe pecu kesiu cuhdi. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Dede Jisu nreugwang pa ledeukelumedung de piegai nah Peter de kesiu eh rangdi, “Acaile gwangdi Satan! Kedanemene nang Tinggwang hadung de n kecet ga kaima, dede mina hadung cetla.” <verse eid="MRK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Ge pa maadi nah pa ledeukelumedung de si eh qulwe penui dage rangdi, “Keheibede a caisui neucai, pekatei pecu kezeulu eh pe krus pwalu, delwe a caisuilu maisia. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Keheibe de perabe de kelilu neu kelame pa cide tei ngga dizie lu, dede keheibe de a ziemne nah samliakeyibe ziemne pe rabe ngga kegaibe cide kelilu zie. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Kedanemene mige kideu pelane gielu liede, pe rabe tei nggah dicai pekemmi dai bamno? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Mige pe rabe ding daipai peulu bui no? Magede ma. <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Kedanemene keheibe de kemmha nah kemau ceheu aide gade a ha nah a sam ziemne ngngam dicai, Mina Nabe de pe pei kendu kemci tinggimgwame de si eh cailigwang kecu dau pe ziemne ngngam dizie.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Nah Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, aika kesap nnui kangge Tinggwang hegwang kengkieng si eh kegwang kengau dwa ketsai msi lak.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Teintsam kelia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Lang herokne cai, Jisu Peter, James, nah John penuide nzang lamlwa kehu ge ga penuikatei hangdi. Iciu eh pa penui dwaga de pecu tei ntsamdi. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Pe paini mhei liklik eh ha pwa kideu ga paini kehetame nede teiha sigai kelak teidi. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Cidau Elijah, Moses de ngngwalwe penuide peu ngaugai, nah penai Jisu de ngngwa mpau bam. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Cine Peter Jisu de mpau eh rangdi, “Keledeubo, anui aika bamcai yizie da, nah cine anui paiki kecum teigo, ket nziemne, ket Moses ziemne nah ket Elijah ziemne.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />(Kedanemene penui ngngiham di eh pa dai rang ziebi cita kedine.) <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Cidau hemwa ge himgwang penuide gumlu, iciu eh hemwa gade makwa ge gwang, “Aide a Na akube. Pe kwa kingneilu.” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Zette, penui pie twagwa kegai dau, penui migede de penuida kela ngau sitadi, Jisu de gwale.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Penui lamlwa gade nghung keladau, Mina Nabe ketsai gade ringcuh dailu kemaktane penui kengaudung midage de rang helo penuide aja kaigai. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Cine makie cide penuikatei kaizeudi, dede penui kakga de penui “Ketsai gade cuh kecuh” pekie dai bi kecu penui katei mpau ladi. <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Iciu eh penui pecu keteu, “Daitei laisiukecime Elijah gwang rai maisia lie rang lano?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5-6">Mal. 4:5-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Jisu penuide keligai, “Elijah gwang rai eh maleune teihemi daibeu zie lie la. Iciucai daitei mina Nabe de peu ma kekiee gade keherei nah mlaidi zielie kesanglaisiu ga rauteu lano? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Dede Ih nnui dage rangla Elijah gwang kesang da, nah penui pe dage teigai keneube teigai dida, kesanglaisiu ga pe ha rauteu kela nzwa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kemau rabe kela na gede teingkei kebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Jisu nah ledeukelume hangcum lamlwa nghung ledeukelume kedame da gwang ge, maadi ge penuide twagwa pung kebam ngaulu nah laisiu kecimedung penuide ngngwa kesamlim bam. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Zette, hemaabe Jisu de ngau luge, penui swagahdi, nah pe da pak nghang eh pecu kelum di. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Pa ledeukelumedung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ledeukelumedung: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mede laisiukecime</char></note> de keteu, “Nnui penuide ngngwa dai ha gade kesamlim bam no?” <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Maadi gade kangge pecu samkeligai, “Keledeubo, Ih a napeina de n da ngngwa gwangla. Peda marang gaikelak rabe ge la. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Cide pecu keliang kecudau pecu teingkau dila, nah pe mui tarum eh pe gei geigim pung nah pa ntingci dila. Ih nang ledeukelume dungde cide de gwampet kera kiegai, dede penui cide tei luma.” <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Pa penuide samkeligai, “Nnui nlumkemak ceheu, Ih nnui de daitie ge ngngwa bam zieno? Daitie ge Ih nnuide ngngwa liabam zieno. Henabe de a da ngngwa gwanglo.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Cine penui henabe de peda ngngwa gwang. Herakesiabe Jisu de ngau luge zette eh pecu kelienmie di nah henabe hangdeu ga kauzeu eh mlapwa ladi pemui tarum eh. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Jisu pe pei de keteu, “Daitie ge pa aiciu ladi deno?” Ge pepei ranggai, “Pe henane gade. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Cide pecu tei ngkapti kerane pecu kelien pwa mi gage nah dui gage kaidi la. Dede nang tei lubui cai anuide ngaunggia eh anuide nghalo,” <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Jisu pe dade rangdi, “‘Nang tei lubui cai lieni’? Nlum kelame ziemne maleune tei lubui.” <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Zette eh henabe pei sahbak eh rangdi, “Ih nlum lie! A kenlum kecam aide de ngha lo!” <verse eid="MRK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Ge Jisu maadibe penui da pakgwang kela ngaulu, pa mcikemak rabe de kesiu eh ranggai, “Nang marang gai kelak nah kwenpang rabe, Ih n dage rangla, pe dade mpet dilu, nah madaude nlütdai so.” <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Cide mra gai eh henabe de de tei kelütsüt gai eh mpetti. Henabe ketsaime nzwa di, cine mina kekiee rangdi, “Pa tsai dida.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Dede Jisu pe ba teulwe pecu teu ncuhlu nah henabe saplu. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Pecai Jisu kilung ga nlüt luge, pa ledeukelume ngkim eh pe dade keteu, “Daitei anui cide de gwa mpet lu meno?” <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Ge Jisu penuide keligai, “Aikenzwabe kekie nah kemmwang gade mai gwa mpet gailak.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung ga, nah kemmwang </char><char style="fqa">de kecu de sila ma</char> dede de laisiudung yitube ga cide sila. </note><verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Pecai Jisu nah ledeukelume cikade tetpet Galilee cuikui kahgwang, dede pa cide peu migede de cineu ma, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />kedanemene kebwak mene pa ledeukelumedung de ledeu neu kecune. Pa ranggai, “Mina Nabe de tuipwa minadung ba gage kaidi zie, nah penui pecu teitset dizie. Nah pecu teitset kedi lang cumne cai pa ringcuh dai dizie.” <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Dede penui aipau sam de ci luma nah penui pecu keteu kera de hing ladi.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Caube ditu no?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Jisu nah pa ledeukelume Capernaum namceu ga gwanglu. Pa kilung ga kebam dau, penui de keteu, “Nnui lampuiki gade daige mpau lano?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Dede penui zing dedi. Penui lampuiki ga keladau caube ne ditu ziebi ha rang kesamlim kelane. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Cine pa ntumlwe kereiekenabau de qu hekwalu eh penui dage rangdi, “Magade mige raitu neula cai, pa kamtube nah pelane kila tei maisia.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Pecai pa hena keceunage de pwalu eh pecu penui kakgage kailu. Pa pecu pwalu eh penui dage rangdi, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Keheibe de a zi gade hena keceu aiciu kecu nadung de ngngwa kelume acu ngngwa lula, nah keheibe de acu ngngwa kelume, acu rünne meliene, acu langkegaibe de de ngngwa lula.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anuide mmaula kemakbe au anui kilam da</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />John Jisu dage rangdi, “Keledeubo, anui mige n zi teu herakesiabe de gwala eh ngau, nah anui pecu kaamdi, kedanemene pa anui caisui kemakne.” <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Dede Jisu rangdi, “Pecu kaam diso, kedanemene migede a zi gade makedi tei kelame zette acu rangmsia gai laklu. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Kedanemene anui de renia kemakpe au anui lam delu. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Kedanemene keheibe de nnui le pwane Khrista gu lie eh pezi gade dui piak ge de sak kera nnuide peu cai, Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, pa pe ziehi tei nggah dilak.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kemau teidikela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Nah keheibe de acu nlum kela keceu aidung hangge de de teimsia cai, keniaktsu kedige pe ngwang gage keu punglwe jaaidi gage kelien gai kedibe yiki lie. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Magade n ba ncu teimsia cai, cide dang di. N ba kena teupung eh mijaai ga kenlüt swa au swah delwe kering ga kenlüt be nziemne yiki kecune. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung ga pedum 44 de sila. </char></note> [Cika penui kaude tsai lama, nah mi de mmüt lama.] <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Nah n pi ncu teimsia cai cide dangdi. N pi kena bam eh mijaai gage kelien gai kedi swa au swah eh kering ga kelüt be n ziemne yiki lie. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung ga pedum 46 de sila. </char></note> [Cika penui kau de tsai lama nah mi de mmüt lama.] <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Nah magade n miak ncu teimsia cai, cide letdi. N miak kena bam eh mijaai gage kelien gai kedi swa au miakli eh Tinggwang hegwangram ga kenlüt be au yiki, <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />cika penui kau tsai lama nah mi de mmüt lama.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:24">Isa. 66:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Kedanemene keheibe de de mi le pwa mcai tei eh mrwak kap zie. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Mcai au yi, dede mcai pekum gah dicai, nang daipai pwa cide tei kumlai? Mcai de peu nnui lung ga bamlu nah ketket de ngngwa kezuyi lulo.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Lakcak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Iciu eh Jisu Capernaum pütdi eh tetpwa Judea cuikui nah Jordan Reuki gwale miedi, nah mina maabe peda gwang dailu. Pa teibam kela nzwa penui de ledeu dai. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Cidau Phariseemedung kangge pecu kedei zielie peda gwang eh keteu, “Mi nahpei mege pe nau de keta cide hezai ni?” <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Pa penui sam keligai, “Moses nnuide daitei lulo beuno?” <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Ge penui rangdi, “Moses au nauta laisiu ge raulu delwe pecai pecu langgi dilo beulie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1-3">Hez. 24:1-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Dede Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Pa hezai aide kerau au nnui lung ketakne lie. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Dede damkegai raitu gade au, ‘Tinggwang penaide mipei ge nah mipui gede teigai beulie.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Ken. 1:27</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 5:2">Ken. 5:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />‘Aipau kiede ziemne mipei ge pe pei nah pe pui de gidi zie, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung ga, </char><char style="fqa">nah pe nau de ngngwa ket tei dizie, de kecu si, </char> dede laisiudung yitube ga cide si ma. </note> <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />nah penai hangna ngngwa teih ge tei dizie.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 10:8">Cine penai kena tadi eh teih ge dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Ken. 2:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Cine Tinggwang ne tei ncüt kebeube mina depeu teu ntsam di helo.” <verse eid="MRK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Pecai penui kilung ga kebam dau, ledeukelumedung aipau hade pe dade keteu dai. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Cine pa penui dage rangdi, “Keheibe de penaude tadi delwe mipui keda de ludai lacai cipau pui zai gikah eh mmhala dida. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Nah pa pe nahpei de ngngwa lung tadi eh kedame pei da ngngwalung daicai pa mmhala dida.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Henamedung nah Jisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Cidau mina kangge henamedung de peda ngngwa gwang pecu peu penuide samlam kerane, dede ledeukelumedung penuide kesiudi. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Dede Jisu cide ngaulu ge, pa pe ratadi nah penui dage rangdi, “Henamedung de peu ada gwanglo, nah penui de kaam helo, kedanemene Tinggwang hegwangram au penui kenzwame gulu. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, keheibe de hename ge nzwa eh Tinggwang hegwang ketei luulu mecai cika lüt gailak.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Iciu eh pa henamedung de pe baga pwalu delwe pe ba penui reu gage kai eh samlambeu.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makehei rehangme ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Pecai pa Jerusalem ga miekera tetcuh daige, mige peda pak gwang eh pedwa koktungmie pecu keteu, “Keledeu keyibo, Ih kelungta kering gumlu kerane dai teilu maisia no?” <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Jisu pe sam keligai, “Daitei nang acu keyibe lie qula no? Tinggwang gwale migede keyi gah. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Nang hezaidung de cibam: ‘Mide daptset so, mmha so, rega so, kenret zierang tei so, mide cwa so, n pui n pei de rütlu.’” <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Dede mina be pe dage rangdi, “Keledeubo, hezai aidung pelane Ih a rehang ting gade nzaila dida.” <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Ge Jisu pecu piegai eh pecu hungdi. Cine pa pe dage rangdi, “Nang mage cangma. Mie delwe ngu kebam leune zwa dilu, delwe kegahme de peudi lo, iciu de nang tinggim ga n mabam bam luzie. Delwe gwang acai sui lulo.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Dede pa sam aide ziemne pe suisia süt eh tetdi, kedanemene pa maheisüt kecume ge kecune.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Pecai Jisu pie twagwa gai eh pa ledeukelumedung dage rangdi, “Keheime Tinggwang hegwangram ga nlütkera dai kenzwa gede teipa zieno!” <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Pe sam de ziemne pa ledeukelumedung penui swa gahdi. Dede Jisu penui sam keli dai eh ranggai, “Henamedung, Tinggwang hegwangram ga lüt kera daikenzwa gede pano! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Keheime ge Tinggwang hegwangram ga nlüt kera swa au ut gede peu langhim miki gade kempet be reluiki zie.” <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Penui macang sütdi eh ketket dage rang eh, “Iciucai caube kelikelu ngau zieno?” <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Jisu penui de piegai eh rangdi, “Mina ne cide teigailak dede Tinggwang teilu bui, kedanemene Tinggwang au ma pelane teilu builu.” <verse eid="MRK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Ge Peter pe dade marang cudi, “Pielo, anui maleune gidi eh ncai suila dida.” <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Jisu rangdi, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, keheibe de ziemne nah samliakeyi de ziemne pe ki, mede sinamedung, mede pe timedung, mede pe pui, mede pe pei, mede henamedung, mede hangdeudung, püt kedime, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />cudau ting<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cudau ting </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Peting aide ga, aipau teilung ga, peting ga. </char></note> ga kidung, nah sinapeidung, nah pe timedung, nah pe puimedung nah, pe namedung nah hangdeudung, pia haige kiege ngaugai zie, keherei si eh. Nah gwang kezeu teilung ga kelungta kering ngau zie. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Dede raitume kekiee kamdi zie, nah kekamme raidi zie.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu pe tsit ha mrairang dai kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Pecai penui Jerusalem namdi kehang lampui ga lage, Jisu de penui dwaga la. Ledeukelumedung penui swagahdi nah penui caisui kelamedung ngngi ladi. Pecai Jisu kereiekenabau de ngngwa tsam dailu delwe penui dage pe da daipai tei ziebi ranglia cuhdi. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />“Ainie, anui Jerusalem ga hang lada, nah Mina Nabe de tuipwa cingku kedimedung nah laisiukecime ba gage kai dizie. Penui pecu teitsetdi kera mmau zie nah pecu Gentileme ba gage kaibeu dizie. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Penui pecu henui teizie, pecu mcai nsuilwa zie, pecu dap zie, nah pecu teitsetdi zie, dede langcum ne cai pa ringcuh dizie.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">James penai John kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Pecai Zebedee napei kena James penai John peda gwang eh ranggai, “Keledeubo, anai ndade ma kiezielie kelade keheibe de peu ncu anaide teibeu neu lalie.” <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Cine pa penai dage keteudi, “Acu peu nnaide daige teibeu neu lano?” <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Penai pe dage keligai, “Nang n kendu hegwangram ga n kedibam ga kebam dau, peu anaide hangge de n ba zetle nah hangge de n ba hile bamlo.” <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Dede Jisu penai sam keligai, “Nnai kie kelade nnai ci eh kie lama. Nnai Ih sak zielie kebam piak de sak lubui ni mede Ih duipum teizie lie kebam duipum de pwa duipum teilu buini?” <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Penai Jisu dage rangdi, “Anai teilubui.” Cine Jisu penai dage rangdi, “Ih sak zie lie kebam piakbe au, nnai sak zie, nah Ih duipum tei kelude teu nnaide duipum teizie. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Dede a ba zetle nah a ba hile bamkera au Ih ne peu gailak, dede cide au pwa peuzie lie teleipwa kebamme de peuzie.” <verse eid="MRK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Ge ledeukelume keda kereibau aide sui luge, James penai John de penui rata süt cuhdi. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Cidau Jisu penuide pe dage kugailu eh penui dage rangdi, “Gentileme reu peuketeudung ne penui reu dila, nah penui kedimedung ne penui reu kengkieng teula kecu nnui cibam. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Dede nnui kakga de au peu ciciu dilak. Iciu meliene, keheibe nnui kakga di keneube de peu nnui kila tei maisia, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />nah keheibe de nnui kakge rai keneube de peu nnui pelane baang tei maisia. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Kedanemene Mina Nabe de peu mide pegwa tei zielie gwang ma, dede mi gwatei zielie, nah pe teilung kaibeu eh mina kekie de rilu zielie gwang.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miakcitbe Batimaeus mangaukelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Pecai penui Jericho ga gwanglu. Pa ledeukelumedung nah mina maadi ge de ngngwa Jericho gade tet mpet keladau Timaeus napei Bartimaeus miakcit eh hatyei kelame ge lampuiki kungga ntum bam. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Pa Nazaretme Jisu gwangla lie kecu siu luge, pa sahbak eh rang cuhdi, “David napei Jisu, acu ngaunggia gailo.” <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Mina kekiee ge miakcitbe de zingde dilo pecu kesiudi. Dede pa sah mtei kidi, “David napei acu ngaunggia gailo.” <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Cidau Jisu ntaklu eh pecu qu gailo ranggai. Cine mina miakcitbe de qulu eh pe dage rangdi, “Kuu lu! Cuhlu! Pa ncu quzeu lie.” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Pa pe cwatie lwakdi eh nsau cuhlu, delwe Jisu da gwang. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Cidau Jisu pecu keteugai, “Nang acu peu n dage daitei neula no?” Miakcitbe Jisu dage rangdi “Keledeubo, Ih a miak mangaulu neu lalie.” <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Cidau Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Tetcu, n kenlum ne ncu tei ngkei luda.” Zette eh pa pe miak mangaulu nah pa lampui ga pe caisui ladi.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Hecili eh kelüt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Pecai penui tetpwa Jerusalem namdi tai Olive Deutu ga Bethphage<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bethphage: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bethsphage dede la, Jisu pe caisuime de gada nah gada na teu gwanglo kie kegai nam de.</char></note> penai Bethany nam ga gwanglu, ge Jisu ledeukelume hangna de langgai <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />nah penai dage rangdi, “Mie anuide mcwakebam nam ga lütlo. Nnai cika lütlu siakte pedwa migede cwakemak gada nage de keupwa kebam nnai ngaulu zie. Cide hiaklwe a da teugwang lo. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Magade mikangge nnaide, ‘Nnai daitei aide tei lano?’ de eh keteucai, nnai, ‘Rampaube cide teu maisia zeulie, nah aika lang caili zette dai beuzie,’” de ranglu. <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Cine penai gwang ge puidiki mbie ga kikam ge caiga gada nage de keupwa bam eh ngaulu, nah penai cide hiaklu. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Cidau cika sap kebamme midungge penai dage keteudi, “Nnai daitei gada nade heu zeuno?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Cine penai Jisu ne rangkebeu nzwa penuide rangbeu, ge penui penaide keulwe tet lulo beu. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Pecai ledeukelume kena de gada nade Jisu da ngngwa gwanglu, nah pereu gage penui pai kamgai beu nah Jisu pereu ga bamlu. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Mina kekiee ge penui paini lampuiki gage kamgai, nah kedame tsingkiakdung penui luhdung gade bi keludung kamgai. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Jisu dwaga tet kelame de nah pe caisui kelame de sahbak eh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 11:9">“Hosanna!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hosanna: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pekie “kelikelu, kelikelube”</char></note> Rampaube zi teu eh gwang kelame samlam pungtu lie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Lei. 118:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Gwang kela anui pau David gwangram samlam pungtu lie!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 11:10">Hosanna hutube!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:39">Mat. 23:39</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Pecai Jisu Jerusalem namdi ga lütlu, delwe pa kerecaki ga lütlu eh pa nreu gwang maleune piegai. Cidau tinghegi di, cine pa kereiekenabau de ngngwa Bethany nam ga gwangdi.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu kerecaki teikemci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Pecai benai, penui Bethany gade caili dai kecu dau, pa mzeu di. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Cidau kemdei gade tangzüttsi bang ge penei bwa kebam ngau, cine pa cika petsi gede ngaulu kera regui eh pet. Dede pa cika gwang ge, peneidung gwale pa magede ngaulu ma, cidau tangzüttsi kebui ting kemakne. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Pecai pa tsingbang de de ranggai, “Mige de n dade n tsi tyei dailak.” Nah pa ledeukelume cide siulu.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Pecai penui Jerusalem namdi ga gwanglu, delwe pa kerecaki kigu ga lüt eh kerecaki ga mazwa nah lui kebamdung de gwadi. Pa rangkang hiak kebam bamdung, nah ruipuinedung zwa kebam bamdung kwak nkum kapti, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />nah pa migede de peu kerecaki ga helinia pung kahkegwang tadi. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Iciu eh Pa penuide ledeu eh ranggai, “Kesanglaisiu ga raunzeu meni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 11:17">‘A ki de lepwa heleuh pelane ziemne kekie ki ge teizie’?</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 11:17">Dede nnui sütketyeime ki ge tei dida.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa. 56:7</ref>, <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jer. 7:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Cingku kedimedung nah laisiukecime aide siulu, nah penui pecu teitsetdi kera lampui peiladi. Penui pecu hingdi kedanemene mina maabe pelane pe keledeu ci eh penui macangkap kedine. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Tinghegi gwang dige, penui namdibe gade lamna di.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Reguikedi tangzüt tsingbang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Ge penui tingcang tetgwang zeuge, tangzüttsi bang pe mah kecang kii kedi penui ngaulu. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Ge Peter nsung daulu eh pe dage rangdi, “Rabbi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rabbi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jewme laisiu kecibe mede keleudeume ge, keraide Jewme zai pei nah ledeu kelabe. </char></note> pielo! Tangzüttsi bang nang resetkedi de kii dida.” <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Tinggwang de nlum lulo. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, keheibe de aipau lamlwa dede, ‘Cuhlu delwe jaaidi ga lüt dilu,’ de eh pe lung gade suihau mezing pa rang kegai de tei lubui lie nlum lucai, cide pecu tei beuzie. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Cine Ih nnui dage rangla: Maleune de nnui kekie be nah peikelabe, cide nnui ngaulu delie kecu nlum siakte lulo, iciu cai cide nnui gu tei luzie. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Nnui kie zielie sapkelu dau, nnui kangge da madungge petau kemak lacai cide nnui gibeurai dilo, iciu cai tinggim kebam nnui Pei de nnui maudung gibeu zie.” <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung ga pedum 26 de si la (Mat. 6:15 gade ngaulu bui). </char></note> [Dede magade nnui gibeu mecai tinggim kebam nnui Pei de nnui maudung gi beulak.]<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu kengkieng keteukecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Pecai penui Jerusalem ga gwang dailu. Jisu kerecaki ga rwa lage, cingku kedimedung, laisiukecime, nah hangkiamedung peda gwang. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Penui pecu keteudi, “Nang dai kengkieng teu eh ma aidungde teila no, nah caune aide teikera ncu kengkieng peu no?” <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Jisu penui sam keligai, “Ih de nnui de mage keteu zie. Acu keligai lo, iciu de Ih dai kengkieng teu eh ma aidungde teila bi nnui dage ranglia zie. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Acu keligai lo, John tei kela duipum de tinggim gade mi mina dade no?” <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Penui katei penui kakgade mpau eh ranggai, “Anui dai ranglai? Magade anui, ‘Tinggim gade,’ de rangcai, ‘Iciucai nnui daitei pecu nlum meno?’ de eh pa rangzie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung, </char><char style="fqa">Anui dai ranglai? de kecude si lama </char> dede laisiudung yitube ga cide sila. </note> <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Dede magade anui, ‘Mina dade,’ de eh rangcai. Penui minadung de ngngidi, kedanemene mileune de John au caihakecime gelie la kedine. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Cine penui Jisu sam keligai, “Anui ci melie.” Cine Jisu penui dage ranggai, “Ih de dai kengkieng teu eh ma aidungde teila bi nnui dage ranglak.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Hetaketeime samgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Ge pecai Jisu samgwa gade penui dage marang cuhdi: “Mige kubeluh ge talu, cide rie twagwa lu, nah zauniakbam ziemne hekwaki ge kuilu. Nah pa reketbam kehuge teilu, nah luh cide kubeluh ketamedung de nlum beudi, iciu eh pa hebeuh ge tei tetdi. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Luhlüt ting dige, pa kilame gede luh ketame dage langgai, kubetsi kesa kubeluh ketame dade ngaulu kerane. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Dede penui pecu nimlu eh pecu dap, delwe magede si mene pecu lang caili di. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Pecaide pa kila kedage de penui dage langgai dai, ge penui pecu pepeu tei rezamdi nah pecu teu hengam teidi. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Pa kedage de lang daigai, ge penui aipau dede teitsetdi. Pa kedame kekiee ge de lang daigai: ge penui kangge de dap nah kedadung de teitsetdi. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Pa hangge langgai kera bamreu, cide peku pe nabe. Pa pecule pwa kamtube tei eh penui dage langgai nah pekatei pecu mpau eh ranggai, ‘Penui a napei de rüt luzie.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Dede luh ketamedung penui hangge ge dage rang eh, ‘Aide ai mapwabe da. Gwanglu, anui pecu teitset digo, iciu de anui pe mabam anui gu luzie.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Cine penui pecu nimlu eh pecu teitsetdi, delwe ketsai paau de kubeluh gwale ge kelien mpetdi. <verse eid="MRK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Cine cu, kubeluh mpaube dai tei lai? Pa gwang eh kubeluh ketamedung de teitsetdi dizie, delwe luh cide mi kedame de peu dizie. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Nnui kesanglaisiu aide pei meni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Tangtsu ki keteimedung gikedi de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">aide kimiaktsu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kimiaktsu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cide “kimiak peube,” de kecu de rangbam, “kimiaktsu ditube” de eh de qula.</char></note> ge tei dida.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Aide Rampaube dade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:11">nah cide anui miak gade miswagahsüt kecu ge.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:23">Lei. 118:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Ge penui Jisu de tui kera peeidi, dede penui hemaabe de hingdi, kedanemene pa penuide mmau eh samgwa aide rang kegai penui ci kelune. Cine penui pecu gidi eh tetdi.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Caesar raha kepeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Pecai penui pecu samdung gade mmau eh tuilu kerane Phariseeme nah Herodiame kangge de pe dage langgai. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Penui gwang luge, penui pe dage rangdi, “Keledeubo, nang masang lie kecu anui cibam, nah nang mige dade de tsam lama, kedanemene, nang mina de hegwazu pie la kemakne. Meliene, nang Tinggwang zaibe kesangbe gade ledeu lala. Cine Ceasar dage heraha kepeu petau mi meno? Anui cide peu kera mi, peu kerabe meno?” <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Dede Jisu penui hezai tei kebam cilu eh penui dage rangdi, “Daitei nnui acu kedei lano? Acu denarius ge keugwang beulo iciu eh Ih cide pielu kerane.” <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Cine penui ket keugwang beu. Ge pa penui dage rangdi, “Aide cau mie nah cau zi no?” Penui pe dage rangdi, “Ceasar lie.” <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Cidau Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Ceasar gu Ceasar de peu dilu, nah Tinggwang gu Tinggwang de peu dilu.” Ge penui pecu ngau penui swagahdi.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ringcuhdai kecu ga laktak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Pecai Sadduceeme kangge, mina ketsai gade ringcuhdai laklie rangkelame, peda gwang. Penui pecu keteu eh ranggai, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Keledeubo, Moses anui ziemne raubeu, ‘Mige sinabe pe na gah eh tsaidi eh penau de bang zeu cai, iciu cai pe sinabe tsai kedibe nau de pa ngngwa lunghlu eh penai na de pesinabe tsai kedibe na teilu maisia.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5-10">Hez. 25:5-10</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 38:8-9">Ken. 38:8-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Ndaa kelak ge ga siname hang hena bamla; raitube pe nau teilu nah pe leuh lung mene tsaidi. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Cidau pekenabe cipau pui dede pe nau dailu, delwe pe leuh lung mene tsaidi, nah pe kecumbe de cinzwadi. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Pe henabe de pe leuh lunghdiak ma. Kamtube mipui de tsaidi. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Ketsaime ringcuhdai kecu ga, penui cuhdai kecudau, mipui cide caube nau zieno? Kedanemene, mipui cide siname hanghena pelane nau dide kecune.” <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Jisu penui sam keligai, “Nnui kesanglaisiu de nah Tinggwang kengkieng de cikemak kie de ziemne nnui maci mau la dide meluini? <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Kedanemene penui ketsai gade cuh kecu dau, penui laktak teilak, mede laktak tei kera gede bam lak, dede penui au tinggim ga tinggimgwame nzwa dizie. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Dede ketsaime ringcuh dai kedime ha, nnui Moses laisiukwak ga, Tinggwang pe dage tsinghum gade, ‘Ih au Abraham Tinggwang, nah Isaac Tinggwang, nah Jacob Tinggwang’ de kerang hade pei meni?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:2-6">Hez. 3:2-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Tinggwang au ketsaime Tinggwang ma, dede keringme gu. Nnui cetmau sütla dida.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samkaikebeu ditube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Cidau laisiukecime ge gwang nah ma aide penui mpau kebam siulu. Jisu penui sam keli hemisüt kebam pa ngau kelu dau, pa pe dage keteugai, “Hezai pelane kakga de dai dele raitu kerabe no?” <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Ge Jisu sam keligai, “Raitube au, ‘kingnei lulo Israel, Rampaube anui Tinggwang, Rampaube au ket rünne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4">Hez. 6:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Rampaube n Tinggwang de nang n mlung pelane, n keringria pelane, n lungcet pelane, nah n kengkieng pelane teu hung lulo.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Hez. 6:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Hezai kai kebeu pe kenabe liecai aide, ‘Nang n kidacaina de nkatei ncu hung kecu nzwa hung lulo.’ Hezai kai kebeu aide swa magede keda kedi bam si meda.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev. 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Ge laisiukecime pe dage rangdi, “Petauda, Keledeubo! Tinggwang au ket lie kecu nang kesangsiakpe rangda, nah pa gwale migede keda bam si melie kecu. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Pecu milung pekiene, nah mi lungcet pelane nah mi kengkieng pelane, nah mikatei mide kehung nzwa kidacaina de hung kera, aide au keru recadung nah ratakdung pelane swade yiki.” <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Pa mteu süt eh pe sam kelikegai Jisu ngau luge, pa pe dage rangdi, “Nang Tinggwang hegwangram gade mdei meda.” Cipaucai, migede Jisu dade magede keteu hingdi.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista caube na no?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Jisu kerecaki ga mide ledeu kebam dau, pa keteugai, “Daitei laisiukecime Khrista de David napei lie eh rang lano? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />David Kemci Rabe gade pekatei rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Rampaube a Rampaube dage ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">“A ba zetle ga bam lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">Ih n ngauraume de n pidau tei beudi kemaktane.”’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Lei. 110:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />David pekatei pecu lepwa ‘Rampaubo’ de qu lala, cine dai nzwa pa David napei lulai?” Hemaa maadibe neunga eh pecu kingnei bam di.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Jisu ledeu bam eh pa rangdi, “Laisiu kecimedung dade mriak lulo, penui paini ketie teu eh litak nidung ga penuide kelum bam kecu penui suiyi la, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />nah synagoguedung ga teibam mlangtubedung ga, nah taktyei ngyidung ga henidung mlangtubedung ga. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Penui hemipuime kidung kumtyei lala, nah penui mide peu ngau kera ziemne kekie tei tie süt lala. Mina aidungde au saja kedi ngauzie.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hemipui makai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Pecai Jisu kerecaki ga ma kehekwabung dwaga bamlu; pa mina maadung dainzwa ma kehekwabung gage rangkang kaibam bi pie mcet bam. Makeheimedung makai kekiee kai bam. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Pecai makegah hemipui ge gwang tamrine kena kaigai, cide peusa pakke nsam ge. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Ge Jisu pa ledeukelume de qulu eh penui dage rangdi, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, penui pelane ma kehekwabung gage makai kebam kakte, makegah hemipui makai aidele pwane kietu lie. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Kedanemene penui au mabam kekiee ge kebam gade pwa peu bam. Dede hemipui aide au, pe magah gade kebam pekiene, nah pa teu lungsi kera pekiene pa kai dida.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Kamtule zasidung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Pecai kerecaki gade Jisu tet mpetdi zeu ge, pa ledeukelume hangge pe dage rangdi, “Pielo keledeubo! Miswakegah tangtsu aidungde nah misuikegah kidung de!” <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Nnui ki kedi aidungde ngau bam mi? Tangtsu ket de keda reu ga keswa pwa bam lak, kelien miedi mene.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Cu Jisu kerecaki de kencwa Olive Deutu reuga ntum kebam dau, Peter, James, John, nah Andrew pe da ngkim gwang eh keteugai, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Ma aidungde daidauge tei ziebi anuide ranglia lo? Ma aidung de tei canglai kezeudau daipai rehidung teidi zieno?” <verse eid="MRK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Ge Jisu penui dage rang eh, “Mriak bamlu, peu migede de nnuide cwateu di kelakne. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Mina kekieege a zi teu gwang eh, ‘Ih pa da,’ de rangzie, iciu eh penui mina kekieege de cwateu dizie. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Nnui hereu regi kecu nah hereu regi kebam hadung siu kelu dau, nnuilung keherei diso; ma aidungde tei maisia bam, dede cide au kamtube di mereu. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Heleuh ge ne heleuh keda gede ngaurau cuh dizie, nah hegwang ge ne hegwang keda gede regi zie, luga aika nnuiteu dizie, nah herakumkum dizie. Ma aidungde au kemna tedteei keherei keraidung da.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:24">Jer. 6:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Nnui nnuikatei de mcet siakte bamlu maisia. Penui nnuide baudidung nah synagoguedung dwaga teu gwang zie, nnuide dapzie, nah a ziemne nnui deuceudidung nah hegwangmedung dwa sap zie, iciu eh cide penui dage zierang ge zie. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Dede keraibe samliakeyi heleuhbe pelane dage paulia rai maisia. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Penui nnuide tuilwe mi ba gage kedi kera dau, nnui dai rang zie bi cet pwa nnui lung keherei diso. Dede peting siak dau Tinggwang nnuide ranglo kebeu de ranglu; kedanemene sam kerang de au nnui lak, dede Kemci Rabe ne zielu. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Sinabe pe sinabe de ketsai gage tuigai zie, nah pepei ne pena de cinzwa tei zie. Henamedung penui puipeidung de mlai eh reniacuh zie, iciu eh penuide teitsetdi kera tei zie. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Mileune a zi ziemne nnuide ngaurau dizie. Dede kamtube ga kecang lia kelube, cipaude de kelilu zie.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Dede nnui kengkap kengkau ketei de pa sap kera kemak ga sap bam eh kengau dau (sam aide peu kepeibe de pekie ci lulo), cide kegwang dau Judea cuikui ga kebammedung de peu kwaklu kerane lamlwadung ga pak gailu maisia,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan. 9:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Kiniem reuga kebambe de peu nkangle nghung so, mede peu pekilung nlüt magede keu mpet kera tei so, <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />nah luh ga kelabe dede pe pai keu kera peu pe ki cailigwang so. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Dede cipau tingdau telak kelame nah hename de nepam kelame ainie! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Cide tingtiak dau teidi melu kerane Tinggwang dade kie bamlu. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Kedanemene cidau ting keherei süt dizie kecune, Tinggwang dam kegai raitu gade cu kecang ci kenzwa rei ma, mede pecai caile de ci kenzwa reidai lak lugu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:21">Mat. 24:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Nah Rampaube cipau tingbaziedung de teimdui di melie cai, migede kelilu gailak dizie. Dede pa kedetkelume zi gade tingbaziedung cide pa teimdui dida <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Cine mikeheige n dade, ‘Ainie, Khrista aika bamda!’ mede, ‘Ainie, pa cika bamda!’ de rang de nlumdi helo. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Kedanemene kemret Khrista kekiee nah caihakeci kemretdung gwang dizie nah marehidung nah miswakegahdung teizie, iciu eh teilu buicai, kedetkelume de cwalu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:24">Mat. 24:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Cine nnui mriak bamlu! Ainie, peting dwa Ih nnui dage maleune mrai ranglia beu dida.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Dede cipau tingdau, keherei kelu cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 13:24">tingnaimiak mui dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 13:24">nah hekei pe kebaa peuta dizie;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa. 13:10</ref> </char></note><verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />hegidung tingkam gade cakmie bam dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 13:25">nah tinggimdung ga kengkieng kebamdung de de teukelai dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:4">Isa. 34:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Pecai Mina Nabe hemwa gade kengkieng nah kendu teu eh gwangkela nnui ngau dizie. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Pecai pa tinggimgwame de langgai zie nah pa kedetkelume de tingkai mdai gade, kideutu nli gade tingkam nli kecang hekwalu zie.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Cine tangzüttsibang samgwa de gade ci lulo. Pe kiak renu eh penei bwa kepet dau, nnui hepwak ting mna dida de kecu ci lula. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Cinzwa delwe, nnui ma aidung de tei gwang kengau dau, nnui pa nna la dide lie kecu ci luzie, kimuiki ga bam dida de kecu. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, ma aidung pelane tei gwang kemaktane cudau ceheu aide gahdi lak. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Tingkam nah kideu gah dizie, dede a samdung au madaude gah dilak.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tingba nah bamdakkak cima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Dede cipau tingba de nah pe bamdakkakbe au migede cima, tinggim ga tinggimgwame de, mede Nabe liede, dede Peibe rünne ci.<verse eid="MRK 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Cine mriak bamlu! Kwa nah kie eh bamlu, kedanemene nnui peting be daidau ziebi ci melu. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Cide au mige hebeuh tei kelame ge nzwa da, pa pe ki gidi eh pe kilame ketket kecu de peta ramcau peudi, nah pa kekwabe de mriak eh bam lulo sam kaibeu kedi. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Ciziemne mriak eh bamlu, kedanemene ki mpaube dai dau gwang ziebi nnui ci melu, tinghegi dau ziemi, muisum dau ziemi, mede nrui kekwa dau ziemi, mi tingcang ziebi, <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />mede magade pa zette gwang dicai, pa nnui zipbam eh ngau di lubui. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Cine Ih nnui dage rang kegai de Ih mileune dage ranggai la: Mriak eh bamlo!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Bethany gade Jisu de keniak kelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Cidau Kahkegwang nah Tsehikaikemak Tangku Ngyi langnane dwa, cingku kedimedung nah laisiukecime Jisu de dainzwa ngkimkakke tuilwe pecu teitset lubui bi riem bamdi. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Kedanemene penui hange ge dage, “Hengyi kebam dau mego, iciu eh mina kakgade ma kehebwak petti melu kerane,” de eh rang bamdi.<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Aipau tingdau Jisu Bethany<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bethany: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Hebrew let gade pekie, “Tangzüttsi ki.” Bethany namceu cai Lazarus nah pe tipui kena Mary nah Martha penui nam. </char></note> nam ga pedwa mpa kelabe Simon kiga bam, nah pa taktyeibam ga bam ge, mipui ge pemi kehung keniak-ca, nard kemci le tei kelu alabaster bung ge pwalwe gwang. Pa cipau bung de teipuplwe Jisu peu gage ruigai. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Dede cika midungge penui rata eh penui hange ge dade rangdi, “Daitei lie keniakca aide teingkap bamno? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Kedanemene perim kehengui maca aide zwapwa denarii haicum<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Denarii haicum: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aide mmi ge ziehi nsam ge.</char></note> swade kiee eh tei lubui, nah kegahme de peu lubui.” Nah penui pecu kesiudi. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Dede Jisu rangdi, “Pecu püt dilu. Daitei nnui pecu kelei lano? Pa a ziemne makeyi teigai delie. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Kegahme au nnui da bam muila, nah keheidaude nnui penui dage makeyi tei gai keneu dau teigai lubui, dede nnui acu au ngngwa bam mui lak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Hez. 15:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Pa teilu kebuibe teigai da. Acu kekung mrai mtei eh pa a pum maca le keniak luda. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, kideu pelane ga samliakeyi pau kegwang leu ga, mipui aide tei kegai de rangla zie, pecu kensung gade.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Cidau Judas Iscariot, kereiehkena bau gade hangge, pa cingku kedimedung da miedi, iciu eh pa Jisu de penui ba gage tuigai beulu kerane. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Cingku kedimedung cide siulu ge, penui suiyi eh pecu rangkang peu zielie sampet gai. Cine pa Jisu de tuigai beulu kera ziuyi keyi peei ladi.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rampaube de kensungtaktyei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Ge Tsehi kai kemak Tangku Ngyi raitu benai, penui Kahkegwang Ngyi meurünna de teu ratak ketei dau, pa ledeukelume pe dage rangdi, “Nang anuide peu daiga de mie taktyei telei neuno, iciu eh nang cikade Kahkegwang Ngyi taktyei teilu kerane?” <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Ge pa ledeukelume hangna de langgai eh penai dage rangdi, “Nnai Jerusalem namdi ga mie culo, nah cika mige duibung pwa kelage nnaide dauzie. Pecai suilu. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Pa kelüt ga lüt cipau ki mpaube dage ranglo, ‘Keledeube rangzeu, “Ih ledeukelumedung de ngngwa Kahkegwang ngyi taktyei de tyei kera sang kibung daiga bam no?”’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Pa nnaide kibung nreule kedige mteilu delwe lamlui hemisüt kenzeu saulia zie. Cika ge anui ziemne ma telei lulo.” <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Cine ledeukelube kena pet eh namdi ga miedi. Ge pa penai dage rangkebeu nzwa bam eh penai cide ngaulu, iciu eh penai Kahkegwang taktyei teleilu.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Pecai, tinghegi miedi ge, pa kereiekena bau de ngngwa gwang. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Penui taktyeibam ga ngngei eh matyei bam ge Jisu rangdi, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, nnui acu ngngwa matyei kebamme hangge acu mi ba gage tui gaizie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Lei. 41:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Ge penui lung keherei eh penui hangge ge kecu pe dade, “Ih au maha?” de keteudi. <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Ge Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Cide Kereiekena gade hangge zie, acu ngngwa tangku hekwak gage mpung kecube de da. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Kedanemene Mina Nabe au pe ha kesanglaisiu ga raupwa kela nzwa di laizeu delu. Dede Mina Nabe de tui pwa mi ba gage kekaibe ziemne au ainie! Mina cipaude au pecu mna kemakbe pe ziemne yiki.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Penui matyei bam ge, Jisu tangku keupwa cide samlam gai, nah cide teipoplu. Pa cide penui dage peugai eh rangdi, “Aide keulu. Aide a pum delie.” <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Pecai pa hepiakpe de pwalu, Tinggwang de hetwa peugai eh penuide cide peugai, nah penui pelane cikade saklu. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Pa penui dage rangdi, “Aide samkakkelu a jai delie, mi kekiee ziemne lwa kegaibe de delie. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, Ih kubetsi zau aide madaude sak dai si lakta, Ih Tinggwang hegwangram gade kubetsi zau keheci sakdai kemaktane.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Cidau penui lei ge teigai eh, penui Olive Deutu ga miedi.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Peter pecu mlaidi kera mraikerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Ge Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Nnui pelane kau dizie, kedanemene Kesanglaisiu ga ainzwa rauteu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 14:27">‘Ih meurünkekwabe de dap zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 14:27">nah meuründung zangra kap dizie.’<verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Dede Ih ketsai gade cuhdai kelucai, Ih nnui dwa rai eh Galilee lebie mie dizie.” <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Dede Peter pe dage rangdi, “Mileune kau kapti liede Ih au cinzwa dilak.” <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Cidau Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, henai, heziu, Nruirie pe kenapia kwa kemakdwa, nang acu pia cum mlai zie.” <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Dede Peter suihau mezing eh rangdi, “Ih ncu ngngwa tsai maisia di liede, Ih madaude ncu mlai dilak.” Nah penui pelane de cinzwa rangdi.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gethsemane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Ge penui Gethsemane lie kecu gurie gega gwanglu, nah Jisu pa ledeukelumedung dage rangdi, “Ih kekie tei kedi dau, aika bam lu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Ge pa Peter nah James nah John de ngngwa pecu si eh manage mdei pet eh pelung keherei nah lungrei le puihdi. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Pa penui dage rangdi, “A lung keherei pwa tsaidi lai zeuda. Aika kwa eh bamlu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 42:5">Lei. 42:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Cidau manage mdei pet eh, Jisu hangdeu ga nkumpung mie delwe magade tei lubui cai aipau bamdakkak de pe dade kah beulo kiedi. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Pa rangdi, “Apei Tinggwang, maleune teilu kebui nda bam. Nang a dade keherei piak aide keudi beulo. Dede a suibe so, dede n suibe tei lulo.” <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Pecai pa nli mpet ge penui zip bam eh ngaulu, ge pa Peter dage rangdi, “Simon, nang zipti deni? Nang bamdakkak ket te kwabam gailak di deni? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Nnui mdakkepie ga lütdi melu kerane mriak eh bamlu, nah kie lulo. Rabe au neuzeu kesang, dede pumteihbe au nnei.” <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Pa mie dai eh kekie teigai, sam cidungde teu rang eh. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Pa caili mpet daige, pa penuide zipbam eh ngaulu, penui miak mrak bam gailak kedine. Nah penui pe dage dai rang ziebi ci tadi. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Pecai Jisu pe kecumbe de penui da gwang eh penui dage rangdi, “Nnui cude zip eh mtak bam reu ni? Yida! Pe bamdakkak be gwang dida. Ainie! Mina Nabe de kemaume ba gage tuigai beulai bam dida. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Cuhlu; Anui tet cugo. Pielo, acu tuigai zielie kelabe nna dida.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu de tuikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Nah pa marang kebam dau, zette eh Judas, kereiekena bau de hangge, cingku kedimedung, nah laisiukecime, nah hangkiamedung, ne lang kegai kingtiedung nah tsingpakdung pwa kela maadi ge de ngngwa delwe gwang. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Cu pecu tui kegaibe penui dage marehi ge peugai, “Ih kemam kegaibe de, cipaude pa delie. Pecu tuilu delwe kekwa si eh ngngwa tetlu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Cine Judas gwang luge, pa zette Jisu da gwang eh, “Keledeubo,” de ranggai eh pa pecu kemam. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Ge penui pecu heraklu delwe pecu tuilu. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Dede sap kebamme kakte mige pe kingtie züt lwe pwa cingku kedibe kilabe de bi gai eh pekwen dang tütti. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Cidau Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Keregame ge nzwa, kingtiedung nah tsingpakdung pwa eh nnui acu tui zielie gwang lani? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Kerecaki ga tingba ramsangne Ih nnuide ledeu eh ngngwa bamla, nah nnui acu tui ma. Dede kesanglaisiu samdung depeu canglu kerane aide teigai delie.” <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Cidau penui pelane pecu püt eh pak ciaudi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 88:18">Lei. 88:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Cidau rehangme ge Jisu cai suila, pa langcim pai ge rünne bahla. Penui pecu tuilu, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />dede pa langcim pai de pützeudi eh paula eh pakdi.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Ge penui Jisu de cingku kedibe dage ngngwa gwang, nah cika cingku kedime, hangkiamedung, nah laisiukecime pelane ngngwa ngkwa bam. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Cidau Peter kemdei gade pecai sui jüja cingku kedibe kigu ga lütlu. Pa kekwame kakga bamlwe mi ngga eh pekatei pecu teilum bam. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Cidau cingku kedimedung nah Jewme baudi pelane Jisu de teitset lu kerane pemau peei bamdi. Dede penui magede ngaulu tadi. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Kedanemene mina kekiee ge pecu mmau eh kenret zierang teu gwang, dede penui zierang kesuizwa lu ta kedine. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Midungge cuh sap eh pecu mmau eh kenret zierang aide ranggai, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Anui pa kerang siu da, ‘Hebale tei kelu kerecaki aide Ih tei msia dizie, nah Ih langcumne gage heba teu mene kedage teidai luzie.’” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Iciude zierang aide gade penui kesuizwa lu tadi. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Pecai, cingku kedibe penui kakga cuh saplwe Jisu de keteugai, “Nang sam magede keli lakni? Ncu mmau kebam sam aidungde daikenzwadung ge no?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Dede pa zing de bamdi nah sam kette keli tadi. Ge cingku kedibe pecu keteu dai eh rangdi, “Nang Samlam kepung Nabe, Khrista deni?” <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Jisu keligai, “Ih da;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 14:62">nah nnui Mina Nabe de ngau zie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:62">pa kengkieng ba zetle ntum kecudau</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:62">nah tinggim hemwadung gade kegwangdau.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Cidau cingku kedibe pe paidung hiet eh rangdi, “Anui cu zierang daitei peeisi laino?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:63 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:65">Mat. 26:65</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Tinggwang de kerenia sam nnui siuda. Nnui kecet daino?” Ge penui pelane pa tsaibui delie mmaudi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev. 24:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Ge kangge pecu mcai msui lwa, nah pezu dum lwe pecu dap delwe pe dade, “Cairasam ranggai lo!” dedi. Kerecaki kekwame de pecu teulwe pecu kepeu.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peter Jisu de mlaikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Cidau Peter kigu ngkanglebie kebamdau, cingku kedibe kila relei hangge peda gwang. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Pa Peter pekatei pecu teilum kebam ngau, nah pa pecu pieling gai eh ranggai, “Nangde Nazarene Jisu de ngngwa kelabe da.” <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Dede pa cide mlai eh cu, “Ih nang rang kebam ha de ci ma mede cetlu ma,” dedi. Iciu gai eh pa kigu ga tetpet di.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung, “Cidau nruirie kwadi,” dede kehegwa laisiudung yitube ga cipau samria de bam la ma. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Dede kila releipui de pecu cika kebam ngau eh cika sap kebammedung dage rangdai, “Aipau pei de penui hangge da!” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Dede pa cide mlai daidi. Cipau cai matie mene cika sap eh kebammedung Peter dage rang dai, “Nang de penui kakga hangge kesanglie, nangde Galileeme ge delu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Dede pa reset nah sampet eh ranggai, “Nnui rang kebam mina aide caubi Ih ci melei.” <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Ge nruirie zette pia pekenabe kwadi. Cidau Peter Jisu pe dage pedwa rang kebeu de nsunglu: “Nruirie piana kwa kemak dwa, nang acu piacum mlai zie.” Nah pa pe suisia eh hapdi.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Jisu Pilate dwaga kegwang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Tingcang nuge, cingku kedimedung, hangkiamedung nah laisiukecime nah Jewme baudi pelane gwang ngkwalu. Penui Jisu de kanglwe pecu ngngwa tetdi delwe pecu Pilate ba gage kai beudi. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilate pecu keteudi, “Nang Jewme Gwangpei deni?” Cine pa pesam keligai, “Nang kerang deda.” <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Ge cingku kedimedung ma kekie gade pecu mmau bamdi. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Cine Pilate pecu keteu dai, “Nang sam keli lakzing ni? Pielo, penui ncu daikie ge mmau bambi kecu!” <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Dede Jisu magede keli si tadi, iciu eh Pilate pe macangdi.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Cipau ngyi tingdau, Pilate hebaangme gede lungmpet beu kela hezai bam, mina kie kegai keheibe de. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Cipau tingdau mige Barabbas lie kecu mide renia kelame ge hebaangki ga bam, Romme sorkari de renia kecu dau pa mide daptsetdi. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Cidau maadibe Pilate da gwang nah penui ziemne tei beu bam kelade tei beulo de kie cuhdi. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Cine Pilate penuide keteugai, “Nnui peu acu Jewme Gwangpei de lungmpetbeu neu lani?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Kedanemene, cingku kedimedung Jisu de penui riak kecune pe ba gage kai kebeu pa cibam. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Dede cingku kedimedung hemaabe de kecung cuhdi iciu eh peu pecu Barabbas de penui da lungmpet beulu kerane. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Cidau Pilate penui sam keli dai eh rangdi, “Ciciu cai nnui Jewme Gwangpei lie nnui qu kelabe de Ih daitei lai?” <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Dede penui sahbak daigai, “Pecu gwakdi!” <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Cine Pilate penui de keteudi, “Pa dai teimau nzeuno?” Dede penui sah ntei reureu eh, “Pecu gwakdi,” dedi. <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Cine Pilate hemaabe mnungbe teilu neu eh Barabbas de lungmpet penuide peu. Pa Jisu de dapgai delwe pecu gwakdi kerane Romme reugwame ba gage kai beudi.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Reugwame Jisu de henuiketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Ge pecu reugwame ne ngngwa pwa hegwangki ga gwang di (cide deuceudibe tutiak kibung), nah penui reugwame maa pelane de quteu gwang hekwalu. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Penui pai giezam kecuge Jisu de peu teulu, nah penui keriak ncüt kelu hetu peurwa teilu delwe cide pepeu gage kai. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Iciu eh penui pecu kelum cudi: “Jewme Gwangpei de peu ringtie lo!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Penui tsingtie gele pe peu dap nah pecu mcai msuilwa bamdi. Pecu kerüt zai tei eh penui koktung mie. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Penui pecu teu henui tei kedi cai, penui pepai giezam kecude pe dade radi delwe pe paini peu teulu, nah pecu gwaktset kerane ngngwa tetdi.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gwakkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Tetkah kelame ge, Cyreneme Simon (Alexander nah Rufus pei) renam gade gwangla, nah pe kemei tei eh penui peu pecu Jisu krus pwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Penui Jisu de Golgotha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Golgotha: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sam aide hebrew let gade peura bam de rangbam. Aipau sam dede Luke ga, “Calvary,” de eh qu. </char></note> ga ngngwa gwang (heni aide le pwane, “Peura bam,” lie la). <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Penui zau gage myrrh haikelu pecu peu, dede pa cide sak ma. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Pecai penui pecu gwakdi, nah pe paini caube ne dai de keu zie bi dacak eh mzi lu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Lei. 22:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Bamdakkak pe kecumbe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kecumbe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cide tingcang bam hekui.</char></note> dau ge pecu gwakdi. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Nah pecu kemmau sam ainzwa rau pwa bam: “Jewme Gwangpei.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Penui sütketyeime hangna si eh pecu gwakdi, hange pe zetle nah kedabe pe hile. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung ga pedum 28 de sila (Luke 22:37 de pie keda lubui). </char></note> [Kesanglaisiu ga, ‘Pecu kemaume de si eh peilu’ de eh rau kenzeu de tei canglu]<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa. 53:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Mina tetkah kegwangme pecu kiidi, penui peungum delwe ranggai, “Aha! Nang kerecaki tei msiadi delwe lang cumne gage teidai luzie lie kelabe de, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />nkatei ncu kelilu delwe cross gade nghung lulo!” <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Cinzwa eh cingku kedimedung nah laisiukecime de penui kakgade pecu henui tei bam, nah rangdi, “Pa mide au kelilula, dede pekatei pecu au keli gailak dida. <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Peu Khrista, Israelme Gwangpei de krus gade cu nghung lulo, iciu eh anui ngau nah nlum lu kerane,” nah pecu ngngwa gwak kebam kena de pecu kiidi.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu tsit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Nah bamdakkak pe herokbe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Herokbe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cide tingna 12:00</char></note> gwang luge, kideu pelane ga muiting bamdi bamdakkak pe hekuibe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hekuibe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cide tinghegi bam cum.</char></note> di kemaktane. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Bamdakkak pe hekuibe ga Jisu sahbak eh sahgai, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabachthani?” aide pekie, “A Tinggwang, a Tinggwang, daitei nang acu pütdi no?” <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Ge cika sap kebame kangge pe kwa siulu eh penui rangdi, “Ainie, pa Elijah de qu zeuda.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Ge mige pak gwang kehia zau kenlünpai gage kailu delwe cide herwatie gage kailu eh peu pecu cide sak kera pwa peu ranggai, “Pecu kebwak so! Elijah gwang eh pecu teu nghung beu ziemi anui pie go!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Lei. 69:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Pecai Jisu sahbak gai eh pe ngyi tütti. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Cidau kerecaki kehezupai de pe tün gade pe sing ga kecang hakpwa kena teidi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Jisu dwaga sap kebam haireu kedibe Jisu ainzwa eh pe ngyi kamtube tütkedi ngau luge, pa rangdi, “Mina aide Tinggwang Nabe kesang da.” <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Cika mipuidung de kemdei gade pie bam. Penui kakga Mary Magdalene, Mary (Henabe James nah Joses pui), nah Salome de bam. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Pa Galilee ga kela dau penui pe caisui nah pe gwatei. Mipuidung keda kekiee ge pecu Jerusalem gade ngngwa hang kecume de cika bam.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu de kekung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Pecai tinghegi dige, cipau nai Sabbath benai dwa Maketelei Tingba kedine, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Arimathea mepei Joseph, Jewme baudi ga hetwa kepung peupei ge gwang. Pa de Tinggwang hegwangram de kwabam kelame ge. Pa kuu süt delwe Pilate da lüt Jisu paau de kie. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Jisu tsaidi delie kecu ci eh Pilate pe swagahdi, cine pa haireu kedibe de qu teugwang Jisu tsaidi demi keteu. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Pilate aide haireu kedibe dade ci luge, pa ketsai paau de Joseph peu beu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Cine Joseph langcim pai ge luilu, pecu krus gade pwa nghunglu, langcimpai gage pecu hezuilu, delwe tsura gade bung kelu herau gage kaidi. Pecai pa tangtsukang ge pwa herau de ngkuidi. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Mary Magdalene penai Joses pui Mary Jisu de kung kedi ni cide ngau.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Ringcuh kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Pecai Sabbath nai cang kedicai, Mary Magdalene, nah James pui Mary, nah Salome marim kehengui pwa Jisu paau keniak kerane gwang. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Mtakkak raitu benai nuge, tingnaimiak kepet dau penui herau ga miedi. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Penui hangge ge dage ranggai, “Caune anui ziemne herau kimui gade tangtsu de kela gi beulai?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Dede penui ngangcuh pie gaige, tangtsu cide kela kedi ngaulu, tangtsu cide disüt kecu ge. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Iciu eh penui herau lung ga lütge rehangme ge pai keha teulwe zetle ntum bam eh ngaulu, ge penui macangdi. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Dede pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnui ngngi diso. Nnui gwak kedibe, Nazarene, Jisu de peeila. Pa au ring cuh dida! Pa au aika bam meda. Penui pecu kai kezeu ni de pielo. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Dede mie pa ledeukelumedung nah Peter dage rang lialo, ‘Pa nnui dwarai eh Galilee ga gwangla dida. Cika de nnui pecu ngau luzie, pa nnuide rang kebeu nzwa.’”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Pecai penui mpetlu delwe herau gade pakdi, kedanemene penui ncui nah penui macangh süt kedine. Penui magede mige dage de rang ma, kedanemene penui ngngisüt kedine. <verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung ga Mark 16:9-20 de sila. </char></note> [Mtakkak raitu benai nuge, pa ringcuh kedicai, pa Mary Magdalene, pe ne dade herakesia hena gwampet kedibe pui dage pecu lia raitu gai. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Pa mie Jisu de ngngwa bam kelame de pau beu, pelung sia nah hap kebamme de. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Penui pa ringbam nah Mary Magdalene pecu ngau delie kecu siu, dede penui nlum luma.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Aipau cai pa pe caisuime hangna namdi gwale tet gwang kela dau, pecu perehi ketsamtsam gade peu ngaugai. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Penai gwang lwe keda caisuimedung dage ranglia, dede penui penaide nlumlu tadi.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Pecai Jisu kereieket bau taktyeibam ga ngngwa maktyei kebam dau pecu peu ngaugai, nah pa penui nlumkemak nah penui mlung ketakne penuide kesiu, kedanemene pa ketsai gade ringcuh kedi kengaumedung de de penui nlumta kedine. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Pa penui dage rangdi, “Kideu pelane ga mie culo, nah mina pelane dage samliakeyi de ledeu lo. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Keheibe de nlumlu eh duipum tei kelube de kelilu zie, nah nlumlu kemakbe de mmau dizie. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Marehi aidungde nlum kelume leune da lazie: Penui a zi gade herakesiadung de gwagi dizie. Penui helet keheci rang dizie. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Penui bale penui heneidung keucuh zie, nah penui hering sakde, cide penuide gi msia dilak. Penui keteeikeneime reu gage penui ba hwa gaizie, nah penui yi luzie.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Rampaube penuide mpau kegaicai, pecu tinggim ga ngngwa nghang di nah Tinggwang ba zetle bamdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:22">1 Pet. 3:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Ledeukelume kehei leuga mie ledeu ladi, nah Rampaube penuide ngngwa bata tei nah miswakegah batadung tei eh sambe kesang lie kecu rang mci lia.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>